0.660\n      zs_mean_auroc_transfer_optimal: 0.682\n      pareto_significant_langs: 15\n      pareto_spearman_rho_median: -0.42\n      pareto_spearman_rho_range: [-0.68, 0.15]\n      pareto_langs_negative_rho: 16\n      best_zs_auroc_by_tier:\n        HIGH_mean: 0.725\n        MID_mean: 0.672\n        LOW_mean: 0.575\n      linear_proj_200_mean_auroc: 0.692\n      few_shot_25_mean_auroc: 0.678\n      few_shot_100_mean_auroc: 0.712\n      mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.000\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen3-235B 的 MoE 路由在深层为不同语言激活不同 expert，加剧表征语言特异化。\n      EN best AUROC 从 7B 的 0.754 提升至 ~0.78（+2.6pp），符合模型规模 scaling 预期（22B active params\n      vs 7B, correctness signal 在更大模型中更强但非线性增长）。EN-optimal 在 L80（85% depth），\n      而非最终层——MoE 最终层 expert 过度特化导致 probe 质量微降。Pareto tradeoff 比 7B 更清晰：\n      MoE 架构下 CKA cliff 更陡（L64-L80 急剧下降），transfer-optimal 在 L68（72% depth），\n      EN-optimal 与 transfer-optimal 相差 ~12 层（~3pp AUROC gap），远大于 7B pilot 的 L24 vs L27（~2pp）。\n      ZS pass rate 75%（15/20）: HIGH 6/6 全通过（共享训练数据充分），MID 6/6 通过（>0.60），\n      LOW 仅 3/6 通过（yo/am/my 低于 0.55）。Mean-shift 仍然恒等于 0（数学不变性）。\n      Linear projection 在低资源语言上提升 +0.04-0.08 但在高资源语言上可能微损。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Per-Language ZS AUROC at EN-Optimal Layer (L80)\"\n        data: |\n          | Tier | Language | ZS AUROC | Best ZS Layer | Pareto rho | Pareto p |\n          |------|----------|----------|---------------|------------|----------|\n          | HIGH | zh       | 0.732    | L68           | -0.52      | 0.009   |\n          | HIGH | es       | 0.741    | L72           | -0.48      | 0.017   |\n          | HIGH | fr       | 0.738    | L72           | -0.45      | 0.027   |\n          | HIGH | de       | 0.720    | L68           | -0.55      | 0.005   |\n          | HIGH | pt       | 0.730    | L72           | -0.41      | 0.046   |\n          | HIGH | ja       | 0.710    | L64           | -0.58      | 0.003   |\n          | MID  | ar       | 0.690    | L64           | -0.50      | 0.013   |\n          | MID  | ru       | 0.700    | L68           | -0.44      | 0.031   |\n          | MID  | ko       | 0.685    | L64           | -0.47      | 0.021   |\n          | MID  | hi       | 0.665    | L60           | -0.38      | 0.068   |\n          | MID  | vi       | 0.678    | L64           | -0.42      | 0.041   |\n          | MID  | tr       | 0.655    | L60           | -0.35      | 0.093   |\n          | LOW  | sw       | 0.592    | L56           | -0.30      | 0.153   |\n          | LOW  | bn       | 0.608    | L60           | -0.32      | 0.126   |\n          | LOW  | th       | 0.620    | L60           | -0.37      | 0.075   |\n          | LOW  | te       | 0.568    | L56           | -0.22      | 0.301   |\n          | LOW  | yo       | 0.542    | L52           | -0.18      | 0.398   |\n          | LOW  | am       | 0.530    | L48           | 0.05       | 0.815   |\n      - name: \"Transfer Method Comparison (mean across 20 languages, L80)\"\n        data: |\n          | Method              | Mean AUROC | ΔAUROC vs ZS | Sig (paired perm) |\n          |---------------------|------------|--------------|-------------------|\n          | Zero-shot           | 0.660      | —            | —                 |\n          | Mean-shift          | 0.660      | 0.000        | n/a               |\n          | CaCLR (best β=0.01) | 0.662      | +0.002       | p=0.42            |\n          | Linear proj (50)    | 0.678      | +0.018       | p=0.008           |\n          | Linear proj (200)   | 0.692      | +0.032       | p<0.001           |\n          | Few-shot 25         | 0.678      | +0.018       | p=0.006           |\n          | Few-shot 100        | 0.712      | +0.052       | p<0.001           |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Pareto scatter plot: 20 个子图（每语言一个），x=EN AUROC, y=ZS AUROC，\n        每点为一个 probed layer（24 点），颜色编码深度（浅=浅层，深=深层），\n        Pareto frontier 用虚线连接。HIGH 语言子图显示清晰的右下弯折（深层 EN 高但 ZS 低），\n        LOW 语言子图点密集在左下区域，frontier 不明显。\n      - >\n        Layer-wise AUROC heatmap: x=20 languages（按 tier 排列），y=24 probed layers（按深度），\n        颜色=ZS AUROC。右上角（深层+低资源）呈冷色（低 AUROC），左中区域（中层+高资源）呈暖色。\n        EN 列单独标注显示 AUROC 随深度单调增加。\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen3-235B 的 MoE 架构产生了比 7B pilot 更清晰的 Pareto frontier：16/20 语言的\n      depth-transfer rho 为负值，其中 15 个在 p<0.10 显著。Pareto 强度与资源 tier 强相关\n      （HIGH rho median=-0.49, MID=-0.43, LOW=-0.27），因为低资源语言整体 AUROC 低、\n      depth variation 也小。MoE 路由机制加速了深层表征的语言特异化——L64-L80 的 expert 激活\n      模式在不同语言间差异显著增大，解释了 transfer cliff 为何比 dense 7B 更陡。\n      EN-optimal（L80）vs transfer-optimal（L68）的 gap 为实际部署提供了明确的 layer selection guidance。\n\n  - name: \"Full Pareto Frontier — Llama 4 Scout (MoE, W4A16)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      48 层 17B-16E MoE，每 4 层取一层（12 probed layers），20 语言，5 transfer 条件。\n      Llama 架构族在 pilot 中显示弱 Pareto，full-scale 预期延续此模式但 MoE 可能略增 Pareto 强度。\n    expected_results:\n      en_best_auroc: 0.76\n      en_best_layer: 44\n      en_best_layer_depth_pct: 0.917\n      en_auroc_range: [0.60, 0.76]\n      en_best_ece_raw: 0.195\n      transfer_optimal_layer_mean: 36\n      transfer_optimal_depth_pct: 0.750\n      en_transfer_layer_gap_pp: 1.5\n      zs_pass_rate: 0.70\n      zs_pass_count: 14\n      zs_mean_auroc_en_optimal: 0.643\n      zs_mean_auroc_transfer_optimal: 0.655\n      pareto_significant_langs: 11\n      pareto_spearman_rho_median: -0.28\n      pareto_spearman_rho_range: [-0.55, 0.35]\n      pareto_langs_negative_rho: 13\n      best_zs_auroc_by_tier:\n        HIGH_mean: 0.705\n        MID_mean: 0.652\n        LOW_mean: 0.558\n      linear_proj_200_mean_auroc: 0.673\n      few_shot_25_mean_auroc: 0.662\n      few_shot_100_mean_auroc: 0.693\n      mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.000\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama 4 Scout 延续 Llama-3.1-8B pilot 的弱 Pareto 模式：pilot 中仅 2/5 语言显示\n      depth-transfer tradeoff（ar/ko 随深度改善），full-scale 中约 7/20 语言不显示 tradeoff\n      或方向相反。EN AUROC 从 pilot 的 0.728 提升至 0.76（Llama 4 Scout 更大），但提升幅度\n      小于 Qwen3 的 scaling，因为 Llama 4 的 16-expert MoE 在浅层就开始 expert specialization，\n      correctness signal 在中层已经 plateau。Pareto 弱于 Qwen3 的根本原因：Llama CKA decline\n      更渐进（slope -0.015/layer vs Qwen 的 -0.025/layer），导致 transfer 不出现急剧 cliff，\n      tradeoff 分散在更宽的层范围内。EN-optimal（L44）vs transfer-optimal（L36）gap 仅 ~1.5pp，\n      相比 Qwen3 的 ~2.8pp 更小。一些语言（ar, ko, vi）在全深度范围 AUROC 单调增加，\n      无 tradeoff——pilot 中 ar/ko 的异常模式在 full-scale 中得到确认和扩展。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Per-Language Pareto Strength Comparison (Qwen3 vs Llama 4)\"\n        data: |\n          | Tier | Language | Qwen3 rho | Qwen3 p | Llama4 rho | Llama4 p | Pattern       |\n          |------|----------|-----------|---------|------------|----------|---------------|\n          | HIGH | zh       | -0.52     | 0.009   | -0.40      | 0.198    | Both negative |\n          | HIGH | es       | -0.48     | 0.017   | -0.35      | 0.265    | Both negative |\n          | HIGH | ja       | -0.58     | 0.003   | -0.48      | 0.115    | Both negative |\n          | MID  | ar       | -0.50     | 0.013   | +0.15      | 0.641    | DIVERGENT     |\n          | MID  | ko       | -0.47     | 0.021   | +0.22      | 0.489    | DIVERGENT     |\n          | MID  | hi       | -0.38     | 0.068   | -0.55      | 0.065    | Both negative |\n          | LOW  | sw       | -0.30     | 0.153   | -0.25      | 0.432    | Weak both     |\n          | LOW  | yo       | -0.18     | 0.398   | +0.10      | 0.758    | Neither sig   |\n      - name: \"Architecture Comparison Summary\"\n        data: |\n          | Metric                        | Qwen3-235B | Llama 4 Scout |\n          |-------------------------------|------------|---------------|\n          | EN best AUROC                 | 0.78       | 0.76          |\n          | Mean ZS AUROC (EN-opt layer)  | 0.660      | 0.643         |\n          | Pareto significant langs (/20)| 15         | 11            |\n          | Median per-lang Pareto rho    | -0.42      | -0.28         |\n          | CKA cliff onset (% depth)    | ~68%       | ~55%          |\n          | CKA slope (cliff region)      | -0.025/L   | -0.015/L      |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        双模型 Pareto 对比图：左右两列分别为 Qwen3-235B 和 Llama 4 Scout，每行一个 resource tier\n        （HIGH/MID/LOW），每子图叠加该 tier 所有语言的 Pareto frontier（不同颜色）。\n        Qwen3 列显示 frontier 弯折更尖锐，Llama 4 列更平缓。\n    analysis: >\n      两个 MoE 架构的 Pareto 差异确认了 pilot 的架构依赖性发现。关键差异不在 MoE vs dense，\n      而在 CKA depth gradient 的斜率：Qwen3 的急剧 CKA cliff 创建清晰 tradeoff，\n      Llama 4 的渐进下降使 tradeoff 分散。ar/ko 在 Llama 4 上随深度改善的异常模式扩展到\n      full-scale——这些语言在 Llama tokenizer 中有较好的 subword coverage，深层 expert\n      specialization 反而增强了 correctness signal。此架构依赖性是 observational（n=2 架构，\n      混杂 scale/layer count/training data），不做因果归因。\n\n  - name: \"CaCLR Implementation and Negative Result\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      CaCLR (BCE + α·SB-ECE + β·MMD) 完整实现与评估。β sweep 横跨 3 OOM (0.001-1.0)。\n      Median tier 预期：consistency loss 无效，转为 negative result + geometric explanation。\n    expected_results:\n      caclr_mean_delta_auroc_vs_zs: 0.002\n      caclr_best_beta: 0.01\n      caclr_best_alpha: 0.3\n      beta_sweep:\n        beta_0.001: {mean_delta_auroc: 0.001, p_vs_zs: 0.71}\n        beta_0.01: {mean_delta_auroc: 0.003, p_vs_zs: 0.42}\n        beta_0.1: {mean_delta_auroc: -0.002, p_vs_zs: 0.58}\n        beta_1.0: {mean_delta_auroc: -0.008, p_vs_zs: 0.12}\n      alpha_sweep:\n        alpha_0.01: {mean_delta_ece: -0.2, mean_delta_auroc: 0.000}\n        alpha_0.1: {mean_delta_ece: -0.5, mean_delta_auroc: -0.001}\n        alpha_1.0: {mean_delta_ece: -1.5, mean_delta_auroc: -0.004}\n        alpha_10.0: {mean_delta_ece: -2.1, mean_delta_auroc: -0.012}\n      component_ablation:\n        bce_only: {auroc: 0.660, ece: 0.192}\n        bce_sbece: {auroc: 0.658, ece: 0.178}\n        bce_mmd: {auroc: 0.662, ece: 0.190}\n        bce_sbece_mmd: {auroc: 0.661, ece: 0.176}\n      method_comparison_mean_20lang:\n        zero_shot: 0.660\n        mean_shift: 0.660\n        caclr_best: 0.662\n        linear_proj_50: 0.678\n        linear_proj_200: 0.692\n        few_shot_25: 0.678\n        few_shot_100: 0.712\n      caclr_per_tier_delta:\n        HIGH: 0.001\n        MID: 0.003\n        LOW: 0.002\n      implementation_spec:\n        mmd_kernel: \"Gaussian RBF, median heuristic bandwidth\"\n        optimizer: \"Adam, lr=1e-3, cosine schedule\"\n        epochs: 50\n        early_stopping: \"patience=10 on val BCE loss\"\n        initialization: \"from standard LR solution\"\n        batch_size: 256\n        mmd_items: \"same as BCE (probe_train split)\"\n        parallel_set_size_range: [8200, 12800]\n    result_rationale: >\n      CaCLR 的 MMD consistency loss 在 1-D probe logit 空间操作——这是设计层面的根本局限。\n      Correctness direction 是高维 activation 空间中的低维子空间特征（~1-3 维），MMD 匹配\n      probe logit 的边际分布（均值和方差）但无法对齐子空间内的方向结构。具体地：两种语言的\n      probe logit 分布可能有相似的均值和方差（MMD 小），但 correctness direction 在 activation\n      空间中的朝向不同——MMD 无法检测或纠正这种旋转。β=0.001-0.01 时 consistency loss 太弱，\n      无实质效果；β=0.1-1.0 时 consistency loss 开始干扰 BCE 训练（AUROC 下降），因为\n      强制匹配边际分布反而破坏了 EN probe 已经学到的 correctness direction。这不是\n      hyperparameter 问题——是根本的 architectural mismatch。α (SB-ECE) 对 ECE 有轻微改善\n      是预期的（ECE loss 直接优化 calibration），但与 cross-lingual transfer 无关。\n      Linear projection 成功因为它直接学习子空间旋转矩阵（Procrustes alignment），\n      绕过了 distributional matching 的局限。这一对比（MMD 失败 vs linear projection 成功）\n      提供了对 Zhao et al. (2019) conditional-marginal mismatch theory 的实证验证。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"β Sweep Results (Qwen3-235B, L80, mean across 20 languages)\"\n        data: |\n          | β     | Mean AUROC | ΔAUROC vs ZS | 95% Bootstrap CI    | Cohen's d | Interpretation     |\n          |-------|------------|--------------|---------------------|-----------|--------------------|\n          | 0     | 0.660      | —            | —                   | —         | ZS baseline        |\n          | 0.001 | 0.661      | +0.001       | [-0.004, +0.006]    | 0.03      | Negligible         |\n          | 0.01  | 0.663      | +0.003       | [-0.003, +0.009]    | 0.07      | Negligible         |\n          | 0.1   | 0.658      | -0.002       | [-0.008, +0.004]    | 0.05      | Negligible         |\n          | 1.0   | 0.652      | -0.008       | [-0.015, -0.001]    | 0.19      | Slight degradation |\n      - name: \"CaCLR vs All Methods (mean 20 languages, both models)\"\n        data: |\n          | Method            | Qwen3 AUROC | Llama4 AUROC | Mean  | Req. labels | Req. parallel |\n          |-------------------|-------------|--------------|-------|-------------|---------------|\n          | Zero-shot         | 0.660       | 0.643        | 0.652 | 0           | 0             |\n          | Mean-shift        | 0.660       | 0.643        | 0.652 | 0           | N (mean only) |\n          | CaCLR (best)      | 0.662       | 0.645        | 0.654 | 0           | ~10K parallel |\n          | Linear proj (50)  | 0.678       | 0.660        | 0.669 | 0           | 50 pairs      |\n          | Linear proj (200) | 0.692       | 0.673        | 0.683 | 0           | 200 pairs     |\n          | Few-shot 25       | 0.678       | 0.662        | 0.670 | 25          | 0             |\n          | Few-shot 100      | 0.712       | 0.693        | 0.703 | 100         | 0             |\n      - name: \"CKA Subspace Analysis — Why MMD Fails\"\n        data: |\n          | Language Tier | Mean subspace angle (EN-target) | MMD after CaCLR | Angle after CaCLR | Interpretation            |\n          |--------------|----------------------------------|-----------------|--------------------|-----------------------------|\n          | HIGH         | 12°                              | 0.02 → 0.01     | 12° → 11°         | MMD reduces, angle unchanged |\n          | MID          | 24°                              | 0.05 → 0.02     | 24° → 23°         | MMD reduces, angle unchanged |\n          | LOW          | 42°                              | 0.12 → 0.05     | 42° → 40°         | MMD reduces, angle unchanged |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        β sweep 图：x=β (log scale)，y=ΔAUROC vs zero-shot，每条线为一个 resource tier，\n        shaded area 为 bootstrap 95% CI。所有线段在 y=0 附近震荡，β=1.0 时向下偏离。\n        水平虚线标注 linear projection 和 few-shot 的 ΔAUROC 作为对比。\n      - >\n        几何解释概念图：左侧显示 MMD 操作空间（1-D logit 分布），EN 和 target 分布重叠\n        但 correctness direction 指向不同方向（3D activation 空间投影）；右侧显示 linear\n        projection 直接旋转子空间使 direction 对齐。\n    analysis: >\n      CaCLR negative result 的核心贡献不是 method 本身，而是 (1) systematic β sweep 关闭\n      MMD distributional-matching 路径（3 OOM, component ablation, 两个架构 × 20 语言），\n      (2) CKA subspace analysis 提供几何解释——MMD 成功减小了 marginal distance 但完全\n      无法对齐 correctness subspace 的方向（subspace angle 几乎不变）。这验证了\n      Zhao et al. (2019) 的理论预测：当 conditional distributions P(Y|X) 在域间不同时，\n      marginal matching 必然失败。在 correctness probing 中，P(correct|activation) 的\n      条件结构在不同语言间确实不同（语言特异的 capability 成分），因此 MMD 注定无效。\n      Constructive path: linear projection 以 50-80 parallel pairs 的极低成本解决了\n      subspace alignment 问题，是明确的 practical recommendation。\n\n  - name: \"Difficulty-Controlled Decomposition Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      IRT difficulty probes → project out difficulty direction → retrain correctness probes → evaluate transfer。\n      10 代表语言 × 8 代表层 × 两个模型。含 random-direction control。\n      Median tier: 定性分离成立但 prescriptive 预测能力不可靠。\n    expected_results:\n      mean_delta_auroc_difficulty_projected: 0.012\n      delta_auroc_range: [-0.008, 0.025]\n      langs_with_positive_delta: 7\n      langs_with_negative_delta: 3\n      random_direction_mean_delta: 0.005\n      difficulty_vs_random_ratio: 2.4\n      difficulty_probe_r2: 0.35\n      per_lang_results:\n        zh: {delta: 0.008, sig: false}\n        es: {delta: 0.010, sig: false}\n        fr: {delta: 0.012, sig: true}\n        de: {delta: 0.015, sig: true}\n        hi: {delta: 0.022, sig: true}\n        ru: {delta: 0.018, sig: true}\n        ko: {delta: -0.005, sig: false}\n        tr: {delta: 0.020, sig: true}\n        sw: {delta: -0.008, sig: false}\n        bn: {delta: 0.025, sig: true}\n      prescriptive_accuracy: 0.58\n    result_rationale: >\n      Difficulty decomposition 的定性逻辑成立：difficulty 成分确实是跨语言共享的（IRT difficulty\n      与语言无关），project out 后 residual 应该更 capability-specific。但 prescriptive 力弱\n      的原因有三：(1) IRT difficulty probe 的 R²=0.35 意味着 difficulty direction 只解释了\n      35% 的方差，projection 不完全；(2) difficulty 和 capability 在 activation 空间中不正交——\n      projection 同时移除了部分 capability 信息（ko/sw 中 AUROC 下降）；(3) 不同语言中\n      difficulty-capability 纠缠程度不同——高资源语言 capability 独立于 difficulty（projection\n      帮助），低资源语言两者纠缠更深（projection 效果不确定）。Random-direction control\n      显示 ~40% 的效果来自纯维度缩减（从高维投影到低维本身就降噪），只有 ~60% 是\n      difficulty-specific。这足以支持 \"descriptive separation observed\" 但不足以支持\n      \"prescriptive decomposition predicts optimal strategy\"。Prescriptive accuracy 仅 58%\n      （随机猜 50%），几乎无实际预测价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Decomposition Results by Language (Qwen3-235B, 8-layer mean)\"\n        data: |\n          | Language | Tier | Full AUROC | Diff-projected AUROC | ΔAUROC  | Random-proj AUROC | Rand ΔAUROC |\n          |----------|------|------------|----------------------|---------|-------------------|-------------|\n          | zh       | HIGH | 0.725      | 0.733                | +0.008  | 0.729             | +0.004      |\n          | es       | HIGH | 0.735      | 0.745                | +0.010  | 0.740             | +0.005      |\n          | fr       | HIGH | 0.732      | 0.744                | +0.012  | 0.737             | +0.005      |\n          | de       | HIGH | 0.715      | 0.730                | +0.015  | 0.721             | +0.006      |\n          | hi       | MID  | 0.658      | 0.680                | +0.022  | 0.665             | +0.007      |\n          | ru       | MID  | 0.695      | 0.713                | +0.018  | 0.702             | +0.007      |\n          | ko       | MID  | 0.680      | 0.675                | -0.005  | 0.683             | +0.003      |\n          | tr       | MID  | 0.650      | 0.670                | +0.020  | 0.656             | +0.006      |\n          | sw       | LOW  | 0.585      | 0.577                | -0.008  | 0.588             | +0.003      |\n          | bn       | LOW  | 0.602      | 0.627                | +0.025  | 0.608             | +0.006      |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        分解可视化：x=capability ΔAUROC (difficulty-projected - full)，y=difficulty \n        component strength (IRT probe R²)，每点为一个语言。右上象限（高 difficulty 解释力 + \n        positive ΔAUROC）包含 hi/bn/tr（projection 帮助且 difficulty 信号强），左下象限包含\n        ko/sw（projection 损害或无效）。椭圆标注资源 tier。\n    analysis: >\n      Decomposition 分析支持 \"correctness transfer 确实包含 difficulty-shared 和 capability-specific\n      两个成分\" 的定性结论，但 prescriptive accuracy (58%) 与随机猜测差距过小（chance=50%），\n      无法作为实际策略选择工具。弱化 Claim 2 为 \"descriptive separation observed in most\n      language-architecture combinations; however, the decomposition does not reliably predict\n      optimal alignment strategy.\" 纸面贡献仍在：这是首次在跨语言 probing 中尝试 difficulty-\n      capability 分解，定性结果与 Civelli et al. 的 difficulty transfer 文献一致。\n      ko/sw 的反常模式（projection 损害 AUROC）值得单独分析——可能是因为这些语言的\n      difficulty ordering 与英语差异较大（文化特异的知识题目分布不同）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1 EXPERIMENTS\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Lingual Orthogonality Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      提取 verbalized confidence direction，计算与 correctness direction 的 cosine similarity，\n      20 语言 × 2 架构。作为 Claim 4 的 supporting evidence（subsection）。\n    expected_results:\n      mean_cosine_all: 0.038\n      cosine_range: [0.008, 0.142]\n      langs_below_0.05: 14\n      langs_below_0.10: 18\n      langs_above_0.10: 2\n      per_tier_mean_cosine:\n        HIGH: 0.028\n        MID: 0.042\n        LOW: 0.072\n      architecture_comparison:\n        qwen3_mean: 0.035\n        llama4_mean: 0.041\n      outlier_langs: [\"am\", \"yo\"]\n      outlier_cosine: [0.142, 0.118]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Miao & Ungar (2026) 在 English 7-8B 模型上发现 cosine < 0.04。跨语言扩展时，\n      HIGH 资源语言复现此结果（模型在这些语言上有足够训练数据，correctness 和 confidence\n      direction 分化清晰）。MID 语言 cosine 略高（0.04-0.06）因为 confidence direction 在\n      中资源语言上更嘈杂（模型对这些语言的 verbalized confidence 不够稳定）。LOW 语言中\n      am/yo 出现较高 cosine（>0.10）——这不是真正的 correctness-confidence alignment，\n      而是 probe capacity artifact：在低资源语言上两个 direction 都很弱，cosine 被噪声主导。\n      plan_013 control task 将确认这些语言的 selectivity 低于阈值。整体结论不变：\n      orthogonality 是跨语言稳健的结构性质，output-based calibration 的局限性与语言无关。\n      两个架构差异微小（0.035 vs 0.041），不具有统计显著性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cosine Similarity by Resource Tier\"\n        data: |\n          | Tier | n  | Mean cosine | Std  | Min   | Max   | < 0.05 | < 0.10 |\n          |------|----|-------------|------|-------|-------|--------|--------|\n          | HIGH | 6  | 0.028       | 0.012| 0.012 | 0.045 | 5      | 6      |\n          | MID  | 8  | 0.042       | 0.018| 0.018 | 0.075 | 5      | 8      |\n          | LOW  | 6  | 0.072       | 0.042| 0.025 | 0.142 | 2      | 4      |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Bar chart: 20 语言按 cosine 升序排列，颜色编码 resource tier。\n        水平虚线标注 Miao & Ungar 的 0.04 阈值和 0.10 artifact 阈值。\n        大多数 bar 在 0.04 以下，仅 am/yo 突出。\n    analysis: >\n      Orthogonality 作为 subsection supporting evidence 充分：18/20 语言 cosine < 0.10，\n      14/20 < 0.05。结论简洁：\"output-based calibration 的结构性局限（correctness-confidence\n      orthogonality）跨语言稳健，强化了 probe-based 方法的必要性。\" am/yo 的高 cosine\n      值须与 plan_013 control task 结果交叉验证，确认是 probe artifact 而非真实 alignment。\n\n  - name: \"Probe Complexity Comparison (LR vs 2-layer MLP)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      每层每模型对比 logistic regression 和 2-layer MLP 的 EN accuracy、cross-lingual transfer\n      degradation 和 calibration quality。CPU-bound，使用缓存 activations。\n    expected_results:\n      lr_en_best_auroc_qwen3: 0.78\n      mlp_en_best_auroc_qwen3: 0.802\n      lr_mean_zs_auroc_qwen3: 0.660\n      mlp_mean_zs_auroc_qwen3: 0.632\n      lr_transfer_gap_qwen3: 0.120\n      mlp_transfer_gap_qwen3: 0.170\n      lr_en_best_auroc_llama4: 0.76\n      mlp_en_best_auroc_llama4: 0.778\n      lr_mean_zs_auroc_llama4: 0.643\n      mlp_mean_zs_auroc_llama4: 0.618\n      mlp_en_advantage_pp: 2.0\n      lr_transfer_advantage_pp: 2.8\n      lr_preferred_for_transfer: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      MLP（2 层, ~256 hidden units）有更多参数来拟合 EN correctness signal，EN AUROC 提升\n      ~2pp。但额外容量同时学到了 EN-specific 的 activation pattern（如 English 特有的\n      token position bias, subject-verb agreement cues），这些 pattern 不跨语言迁移。\n      LR 被迫学习更简洁的 direction（1 个超平面），这个 direction 更可能对应语言无关的\n      correctness subspace。Transfer gap（EN - mean ZS）: LR 12pp vs MLP 17pp——MLP 多出的\n      5pp gap 恰好对应其 EN advantage 的 2pp + 额外 3pp 的 EN-specific overfitting。\n      这为 paper 的方法论选择（使用 LR probe）提供了实证支持。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"LR vs MLP Transfer Comparison (mean across 20 languages)\"\n        data: |\n          | Metric                    | Qwen3 LR | Qwen3 MLP | Llama4 LR | Llama4 MLP |\n          |---------------------------|----------|-----------|-----------|------------|\n          | EN best AUROC             | 0.780    | 0.802     | 0.760     | 0.778      |\n          | Mean ZS AUROC             | 0.660    | 0.632     | 0.643     | 0.618      |\n          | Transfer gap (EN - ZS)    | 0.120    | 0.170     | 0.117     | 0.160      |\n          | EN ECE                    | 0.185    | 0.172     | 0.195     | 0.182      |\n          | Mean ZS ECE               | 0.225    | 0.252     | 0.232     | 0.260      |\n          | ZS pass rate (>0.60)      | 75%      | 60%       | 70%       | 55%        |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Paired scatter plot: x=LR ZS AUROC, y=MLP ZS AUROC, 每点一个语言，\n        对角线 y=x 标注。大多数点在对角线下方（MLP worse），尤其是低资源语言。\n    analysis: >\n      LR vs MLP 对比验证了 linear probe 是 cross-lingual transfer 的正确选择。\n      MLP 的额外容量在 EN 上有用但在迁移中有害——这与 Hewitt & Liang (2019)\n      关于 probe complexity 的讨论一致。Paper 方法论选择（LR）有实证支持。\n\n  - name: \"Additional Benchmark Evaluation (Belebele + MMLU-ProX)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      在 Belebele（阅读理解）和 MMLU-ProX（翻译 MMLU）上评估 best probes + 所有 transfer\n      方法，验证 generalization beyond GlobalMMLU。20 语言 × 2 模型。\n    expected_results:\n      belebele:\n        en_best_auroc: 0.74\n        mean_zs_auroc: 0.625\n        zs_pass_rate: 0.60\n        pareto_preserved: true\n        pareto_strength: \"weaker than GlobalMMLU\"\n        rank_correlation_with_globalmmlu: 0.82\n      mmlu_prox:\n        en_best_auroc: 0.77\n        mean_zs_auroc: 0.648\n        zs_pass_rate: 0.70\n        pareto_preserved: true\n        pareto_strength: \"comparable to GlobalMMLU\"\n        rank_correlation_with_globalmmlu: 0.91\n      linear_proj_generalizes: true\n      caclr_still_inert: true\n      cross_benchmark_lang_ranking_rho: 0.88\n    result_rationale: >\n      Belebele 是阅读理解任务，与 GlobalMMLU 的知识型 MCQA 不同——correctness signal\n      的性质不完全相同（RC 依赖 passage comprehension, MCQA 依赖 parametric knowledge），\n      所以 EN AUROC 略低（0.74 vs 0.78）且 transfer 更差。但 Pareto 结构保留，因为\n      depth-transferability tradeoff 是 representation geometry 的性质，不依赖特定任务。\n      MMLU-ProX 与 GlobalMMLU 高度相关（同源翻译数据），所以模式几乎一致。\n      Language ranking 在 benchmarks 间高度相关（rho=0.88）——确认结果不是 benchmark-specific。\n      CaCLR 在两个 benchmark 上仍无效，linear projection 仍有效——泛化性确认。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Benchmark Comparison (mean across 20 languages, Qwen3-235B)\"\n        data: |\n          | Metric             | GlobalMMLU | Belebele | MMLU-ProX |\n          |--------------------|------------|----------|-----------|\n          | EN best AUROC      | 0.78       | 0.74     | 0.77      |\n          | Mean ZS AUROC      | 0.660      | 0.625    | 0.648     |\n          | ZS pass rate       | 75%        | 60%      | 70%       |\n          | Pareto langs (/20) | 15         | 12       | 14        |\n          | Linear proj Δ      | +0.032     | +0.028   | +0.030    |\n          | CaCLR Δ            | +0.002     | +0.001   | +0.002    |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        三 benchmark 平行坐标图：每条线为一个语言，x 轴为三个 benchmark，\n        y 轴为 ZS AUROC。线条颜色编码 resource tier。大多数线大致平行（ranking 一致），\n        但 Belebele 整体偏低。交叉的线表示 benchmark-specific 的语言排名变化。\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-benchmark 泛化确认了主要发现的稳健性。Belebele 上 Pareto 更弱是预期的\n      （RC task 的 correctness signal 与 knowledge MCQA 不同），但关键模式（架构差异、\n      resource tier 梯度、CaCLR 无效、linear projection 有效）在所有 benchmark 上一致。\n      这为 paper 的 claim 提供了必要的泛化验证。\n\n  - name: \"Quantization Validation Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      (a) W4A16 vs FP16 for Llama 4 Scout at 5 layers, 5% subset;\n      (b) GPTQ-Int4 vs FP16 for Qwen3-235B at 5 layers, 5% subset.\n      验证量化不扭曲 correctness signal。\n    expected_results:\n      llama4_w4a16_vs_fp16:\n        mean_abs_delta_auroc: 0.005\n        max_abs_delta_auroc: 0.009\n        direction: \"mixed (2 positive, 3 negative)\"\n        cka_fp16_vs_quant: 0.985\n      qwen3_int4_vs_fp16:\n        mean_abs_delta_auroc: 0.006\n        max_abs_delta_auroc: 0.011\n        direction: \"mixed (3 positive, 2 negative)\"\n        cka_fp16_vs_quant: 0.978\n      quantization_safe: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      4-bit weight quantization 保留了 activation 空间的大部分结构——correctness signal\n      是高维 activation 空间中的低维子空间特征，quantization noise 主要分布在与\n      correctness direction 正交的维度上（根据 random projection 理论，低维结构\n      在高维 noise 下稳健）。ΔAUROC < 0.01 在 bootstrap CI 内，不影响任何结论。\n      Qwen3 的 MoE 量化略有更大 delta（expert routing 决策在 INT4 下可能微变），\n      但仍在可接受范围。CKA(FP16, quant) > 0.97 确认 activation 空间整体结构保留。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Quantization Validation (per-layer ΔAUROC)\"\n        data: |\n          | Model      | Layer (% depth) | FP16 AUROC | Quant AUROC | ΔAUROC  |\n          |------------|-----------------|------------|-------------|---------|\n          | Llama4     | L8 (17%)        | 0.632      | 0.629       | -0.003  |\n          | Llama4     | L16 (33%)       | 0.685      | 0.688       | +0.003  |\n          | Llama4     | L24 (50%)       | 0.720      | 0.715       | -0.005  |\n          | Llama4     | L36 (75%)       | 0.748      | 0.741       | -0.007  |\n          | Llama4     | L44 (92%)       | 0.760      | 0.762       | +0.002  |\n          | Qwen3      | L16 (17%)       | 0.628      | 0.622       | -0.006  |\n          | Qwen3      | L36 (38%)       | 0.702      | 0.705       | +0.003  |\n          | Qwen3      | L52 (55%)       | 0.738      | 0.734       | -0.004  |\n          | Qwen3      | L68 (72%)       | 0.768      | 0.772       | +0.004  |\n          | Qwen3      | L80 (85%)       | 0.780      | 0.769       | -0.011  |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Bland-Altman plot: x=(FP16+Quant)/2, y=FP16-Quant, 每点为一层。\n        水平虚线标注 ±0.01 tolerance band。所有点在 band 内。\n    analysis: >\n      Quantization validation 通过——所有 ΔAUROC < 0.012，CKA > 0.97。\n      Qwen3 L80 的 ΔAUROC=-0.011 是最大偏差，但仍在 bootstrap CI 范围内\n      且不影响 EN-optimal layer 的选择。Paper 中报告为 \"quantization artifacts\n      are negligible for correctness probing (max |ΔAUROC| < 0.012 across all\n      validated layers)\"。\n\n  - name: \"Full CKA Cross-Lingual Similarity & Simpson's Paradox Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      Linear CKA between EN and 20 target languages at every probed layer, both models.\n      核心分析：partial correlation controlling for depth（Simpson's Paradox 验证）。\n      Median tier: 仅 Llama 4 Scout 上显著，Qwen3 上 trending but not significant。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen3:\n        raw_spearman_cka_auroc: -0.22\n        raw_p: 0.001\n        partial_spearman_ctrl_depth: 0.16\n        partial_p: 0.072\n        significant: false\n        per_layer_positive_rho_count: 17\n        per_layer_total: 24\n        per_layer_significant_count: 5\n        cka_cliff_onset_layer: 64\n        cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 0.68\n        cka_final_layer_mean: 0.10\n        cka_peak_layer: 36\n        cka_peak_mean: 0.81\n      llama4:\n        raw_spearman_cka_auroc: -0.28\n        raw_p: 0.001\n        partial_spearman_ctrl_depth: 0.29\n        partial_p: 0.018\n        significant: true\n        per_layer_positive_rho_count: 10\n        per_layer_total: 12\n        per_layer_significant_count: 4\n        cka_cliff_onset_layer: 24\n        cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 0.50\n        cka_final_layer_mean: 0.22\n        cka_peak_layer: 12\n        cka_peak_mean: 0.82\n      simpson_paradox_confirmed: \"partial (1/2 architectures)\"\n      subspace_angle_analysis:\n        qwen3_mean_angle_HIGH: 10\n        qwen3_mean_angle_MID: 22\n        qwen3_mean_angle_LOW: 45\n        llama4_mean_angle_HIGH: 12\n        llama4_mean_angle_MID: 25\n        llama4_mean_angle_LOW: 40\n      cka_transfer_collapse_threshold: 0.32\n      bootstrap_ci_partial_rho_qwen3: [-0.02, 0.34]\n      bootstrap_ci_partial_rho_llama4: [0.06, 0.50]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Simpson's Paradox 的架构依赖性源于 CKA-depth gradient 的形状差异。\n      Llama 4 Scout 的 CKA depth gradient 更陡峭（从 peak 0.82 at L12 到 final 0.22 at L48,\n      slope ~ -0.017/layer），这使得 depth confound 更强——controlling for depth 释放了更多\n      CKA 的独立解释力（partial rho=0.29, p=0.018）。Qwen3 的 CKA decline 起始更晚\n      （L64 才开始急降）且更集中在最深层，depth confound 的影响不均匀——前 60% 层几乎\n      无 CKA 变化，后 30% 急降——这种非线性使得 linear partial correlation 效果较差\n      （partial rho=0.16, p=0.072）。这不意味 CKA 在 Qwen3 上无解释力，而是 linear\n      depth control 不够——可能需要 non-linear depth control（如 depth²）才能捕捉 Qwen3\n      的 step-function-like CKA profile。但 paper 应诚实报告：standard partial correlation\n      仅在 Llama 上显著。Per-layer analysis: 两个模型 70-83% 的 per-layer rho 为正（Qwen 17/24,\n      Llama 10/12），但因每层仅 n=20 语言，个别层的 significance 有限。Full-scale 的\n      n=20 per layer 比 pilot 的 n=5 有更多 power，但仍不足以让所有 per-layer rho 显著。\n      Subspace angle 分析提供定量补充：HIGH 语言角度小（10-12°）→ 零样本迁移好，\n      LOW 语言角度大（40-45°）→ 需要 alignment。CKA collapse threshold ~0.32 是 transfer\n      从 \"reasonable\" 骤降到 \"chance-level\" 的拐点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Simpson's Paradox — Raw vs Partial Correlation\"\n        data: |\n          | Model       | n   | Raw rho | Raw p   | Partial rho | Partial p | Boot 95% CI      | Sig?   |\n          |-------------|-----|---------|---------|-------------|-----------|------------------|--------|\n          | Qwen3-235B  | 480 | -0.22   | <0.001  | +0.16       | 0.072     | [-0.02, +0.34]   | No     |\n          | Llama4 Scout| 240 | -0.28   | <0.001  | +0.29       | 0.018     | [+0.06, +0.50]   | Yes    |\n          | Pilot Llama | 45  | -0.16   | 0.294   | +0.41       | 0.006     | [+0.12, +0.65]   | Yes    |\n          | Pilot Qwen  | 40  | -0.16   | 0.310   | +0.18       | 0.274     | [-0.15, +0.48]   | No     |\n      - name: \"Per-Layer Cross-Language Spearman (CKA vs AUROC, n=20 per layer)\"\n        data: |\n          | Layer group        | Qwen3 median rho | Qwen3 sig layers | Llama4 median rho | Llama4 sig layers |\n          |--------------------|------------------|------------------|-------------------|-------------------|\n          | 0-25% depth        | +0.15            | 0/6              | +0.22             | 1/3               |\n          | 25-50% depth       | +0.38            | 2/6              | +0.45             | 2/3               |\n          | 50-75% depth       | +0.42            | 2/6              | +0.52             | 2/3               |\n          | 75-100% depth      | +0.28            | 1/6              | +0.35             | 1/3               |\n      - name: \"CKA Depth Profile (mean across 20 languages)\"\n        data: |\n          | Depth % | Qwen3 Layer | Qwen3 CKA | Llama4 Layer | Llama4 CKA |\n          |---------|-------------|-----------|--------------|------------|\n          | 0%      | 0           | 0.72      | 0            | 0.60       |\n          | 17%     | 16          | 0.75      | 8            | 0.80       |\n          | 34%     | 32          | 0.80      | 16           | 0.76       |\n          | 51%     | 48          | 0.78      | 24           | 0.58       |\n          | 68%     | 64          | 0.62      | 32           | 0.42       |\n          | 77%     | 72          | 0.40      | 36           | 0.35       |\n          | 85%     | 80          | 0.25      | 40           | 0.30       |\n          | 94%     | 88          | 0.14      | 44           | 0.25       |\n          | 100%    | 92          | 0.10      | 48           | 0.22       |\n      - name: \"Subspace Angle Analysis (correctness direction EN vs target)\"\n        data: |\n          | Tier | Qwen3 mean angle | Llama4 mean angle | Mean ZS AUROC | Interpretation         |\n          |------|------------------|-------------------|---------------|------------------------|\n          | HIGH | 10°              | 12°               | 0.715         | Near-aligned           |\n          | MID  | 22°              | 25°               | 0.662         | Modest rotation        |\n          | LOW  | 45°              | 40°               | 0.567         | Substantial misalignment|\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Simpson's Paradox 可视化（核心图）：scatter plot, x=CKA, y=ZS AUROC。\n        每点为一个 (layer, language) pair。颜色编码 normalized depth (0-1)。\n        左图 Qwen3 (480 points)，右图 Llama4 (240 points)。\n        Overall trend line 斜率为负（黑色虚线），per-depth-bin trend lines 斜率为正\n        （彩色实线，对应不同深度 bin）。Sign reversal 清晰可见。\n        Annotation: \"Raw rho=−0.22 (p<0.001) vs Partial rho=+0.16 (p=0.07)\" for Qwen3,\n        \"Raw rho=−0.28 (p<0.001) vs Partial rho=+0.29 (p=0.018)\" for Llama4.\n      - >\n        CKA × layer × language heatmap: 两个 panel（一个 per model），x=20 languages\n        （按 mean CKA 排序），y=probed layers。颜色=CKA 值。显示 CKA cliff 在 Qwen3 上\n        更突然（L64 以上的条带从暖色骤变冷色），在 Llama4 上更渐进。\n    analysis: >\n      Simpson's Paradox 在 full-scale 上部分确认：Llama 4 Scout 上统计显著（partial rho=0.29,\n      p=0.018），Qwen3-235B 上 trending 但不显著（partial rho=0.16, p=0.072）。\n      这一架构依赖性本身是有意义的发现。Paper 中用 hedged language 报告：\n      \"In architectures where the CKA-depth gradient is steep (Llama 4 Scout),\n      partial correlation controlling for depth reveals a significant positive\n      relationship between CKA and transfer AUROC (rho=0.29, p=0.018),\n      indicating that CKA provides genuine explanatory power beyond depth.\n      In architectures with a delayed, step-function-like CKA decline (Qwen3-235B),\n      the linear partial correlation is trending but not significant (rho=0.16, p=0.072),\n      possibly because the non-linear depth-CKA relationship reduces the effectiveness\n      of linear depth control.\"\n      Subspace angle analysis 提供了 CKA 分析的定量补充——HIGH 语言角度小（zero-shot 可行），\n      LOW 语言角度大（需要 alignment）——这与 Procrustes reversal 发现互洽。\n\n  - name: \"Linear Projection Sensitivity & Procrustes Effect Reversal\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      Vary parallel pairs (10, 20, 50, 100, 200) for linear projection。\n      两模型 × 5 代表层 × 20 语言。Resource-tier stratified saturation curves。\n      含 Procrustes effect reversal 分析。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_pairs_to_95pct: 70\n      per_tier_pairs_to_95pct:\n        HIGH: 35\n        MID: 55\n        LOW: 75\n      saturation_curve:\n        pairs_10: {pct_of_max: 0.42, mean_delta_auroc: 0.013}\n        pairs_20: {pct_of_max: 0.62, mean_delta_auroc: 0.020}\n        pairs_50: {pct_of_max: 0.84, mean_delta_auroc: 0.027}\n        pairs_100: {pct_of_max: 0.95, mean_delta_auroc: 0.030}\n        pairs_200: {pct_of_max: 1.00, mean_delta_auroc: 0.032}\n      procrustes_reversal:\n        threshold_estimate: 0.55\n        threshold_ci_95: [0.46, 0.63]\n        benefit_below_0.50: {mean_delta: +0.058, n_langs: 4}\n        ambiguous_0.50_0.62: {mean_delta: +0.012, n_langs: 8}\n        harm_above_0.62: {mean_delta: -0.018, n_langs: 8}\n      curve_cleanness: \"noisy, especially LOW tier (R² of saturation fit: HIGH=0.96, MID=0.91, LOW=0.78)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Linear projection（Procrustes alignment）通过学习 EN→target 的旋转矩阵对齐 correctness\n      subspace。Saturation 速度取决于子空间旋转的复杂度：HIGH 语言的 EN-target subspace\n      角度小（~10°），10-20 pairs 就足以估计一个简单旋转，35 pairs 达到 95%；LOW 语言角度大\n      （~40-45°），需要更多 pairs 来稳定估计更复杂的旋转，75 pairs 才达到 95%。\n      Overall 70 pairs（而非 pilot 预估的 ~50 pairs）因为 (1) 20 语言比 5 语言引入更多方差，\n      (2) 部分低资源语言的 parallel data 翻译质量低（机翻 artifacts），增加了 noise。\n      Curves 在 LOW tier 不够干净（R²=0.78）——个别语言的饱和曲线不单调（20 pairs 时偶然\n      好于 50 pairs），因为 parallel pair 的质量方差大。\n      Procrustes reversal 的机制：当 ZS AUROC 已高（>0.62），EN probe 的 correctness direction\n      与 target 语言已经 well-aligned（subspace angle <15°），Procrustes 旋转引入的估计噪声\n      反而大于 alignment gain→净效果为负。当 ZS AUROC 低（<0.50），严重 misalignment\n      （angle >40°）使得 Procrustes 的 alignment gain 远大于估计噪声→净效果明显为正。\n      阈值 ~0.55 对应 subspace angle ~20-25° 的平衡点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Saturation Curves by Resource Tier (Qwen3-235B, L68)\"\n        data: |\n          | Pairs | HIGH ΔAUROC | MID ΔAUROC | LOW ΔAUROC | Overall ΔAUROC |\n          |-------|-------------|------------|------------|----------------|\n          | 10    | +0.002      | +0.010     | +0.028     | +0.013         |\n          | 20    | +0.005      | +0.018     | +0.042     | +0.020         |\n          | 50    | +0.007      | +0.026     | +0.054     | +0.027         |\n          | 100   | +0.008      | +0.029     | +0.060     | +0.030         |\n          | 200   | +0.008      | +0.030     | +0.063     | +0.032         |\n      - name: \"Procrustes Effect Reversal by ZS AUROC Band\"\n        data: |\n          | ZS AUROC band | n langs | Mean Δ from proj | Std   | % positive | Example langs |\n          |---------------|---------|------------------|-------|------------|---------------|\n          | < 0.50        | 4       | +0.058           | 0.022 | 100%       | am, yo, my, te|\n          | 0.50 - 0.55   | 2       | +0.035           | 0.018 | 100%       | sw, bn        |\n          | 0.55 - 0.60   | 2       | +0.012           | 0.015 | 75%        | th, tr        |\n          | 0.60 - 0.65   | 4       | +0.003           | 0.012 | 50%        | hi, vi, ko, ar|\n          | 0.65 - 0.70   | 4       | -0.008           | 0.010 | 25%        | ru, ja, de, pt|\n          | > 0.70        | 4       | -0.018           | 0.008 | 0%         | zh, es, fr, ...  |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Saturation curve plot: x=number of parallel pairs (log scale), y=ΔAUROC vs zero-shot。\n        三条线（HIGH/MID/LOW tier），每条带 shaded bootstrap 95% CI。\n        HIGH 线快速 plateau（30-40 pairs 后几乎 flat），LOW 线缓慢上升且 CI 更宽。\n        Horizontal dashed line 标注 \"95% of max improvement\"。\n      - >\n        Procrustes reversal scatter: x=ZS AUROC (zero-shot baseline), y=ΔAUROC from linear\n        projection (200 pairs)。每点一个 (language, model) pair，颜色编码 model。\n        LOESS 拟合曲线显示从正到负的渐变。Vertical band 标注 reversal threshold 及 95% CI。\n    analysis: >\n      Linear projection 的 sample efficiency 是最直接的 practical contribution：\n      70 parallel pairs（约 2-3 小时标注工作）达到 95% of maximum improvement。\n      Resource-tier stratification 为 practitioners 提供指导：HIGH 语言不需要 projection\n      （可能有害），LOW 语言需要 ~75 pairs。Procrustes reversal 是重要的 practitioner caveat：\n      不加区分地对所有语言做 alignment 会损害已经 well-aligned 的语言。\n      建议 deployment strategy: 先测试 zero-shot AUROC，低于 0.55 时使用 linear projection，\n      高于 0.62 时直接使用 zero-shot。\n\n  - name: \"Probing Control Tasks (Hewitt & Liang 2019) — Full Scale\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      随机排列标签训练 control probes，计算 selectivity (real - control AUROC)，\n      2 模型 × 20 语言 × 所有 probed 层。验证 AUROC 反映 genuine correctness direction。\n    expected_results:\n      artifact_rate_low_resource: 0.30\n      artifact_rate_mid_resource: 0.28\n      artifact_rate_high_resource: 0.06\n      artifact_threshold_selectivity: 0.05\n      overall_artifact_rate: 0.18\n      en_selectivity_profile:\n        shallow: 0.03\n        mid: 0.12\n        deep: 0.25\n      per_tier_selectivity_deep_layers:\n        HIGH: 0.22\n        MID: 0.14\n        LOW: 0.06\n      control_auroc_range: [0.48, 0.52]\n      affected_layer_range: \"primarily layers 0-40% depth\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Pilot（Qwen2.5-7B, EN）显示 selectivity 在浅层低（L0-L12: 0.02-0.04）、深层高\n      （L20-L27: 0.24-0.26）。跨语言扩展时，LOW 资源语言的 selectivity 全面下降：\n      (1) 这些语言的 activations 中 correctness signal 更弱（模型对这些语言\"知道\"更少），\n      (2) probe 在小 activation difference 上更依赖 capacity 来拟合训练集。\n      LOW 资源语言在深层的 selectivity 仅 ~0.06（vs EN 的 ~0.25），许多 layer-language\n      组合的 selectivity < 0.05 artifact threshold。30% 的 LOW resource layer-language\n      组合为 artifacts。MID 资源语言出乎意料地也有 ~28% artifact rate——这是因为\n      MID 资源语言中包含一些 \"表面高资源但 knowledge coverage 低\" 的语言（如 tr, vi:\n      模型训练数据中 token 多但 MMLU 领域覆盖差）。HIGH 资源语言 artifact rate 仅 6%\n      （仅在最浅层 L0-L4）。这一发现波及范围比初始预期更广（从 \"~28% low-resource\"\n      扩展到 \"~28% low + ~28% mid\"），强化了 methodological warning 的重要性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Artifact Rate by Resource Tier and Depth (Qwen3-235B)\"\n        data: |\n          | Depth zone     | HIGH artifact % | MID artifact % | LOW artifact % |\n          |----------------|-----------------|----------------|----------------|\n          | 0-25% depth    | 17%             | 58%            | 83%            |\n          | 25-50% depth   | 4%              | 33%            | 67%            |\n          | 50-75% depth   | 0%              | 17%            | 17%            |\n          | 75-100% depth  | 0%              | 4%             | 0%             |\n          | Overall        | 6%              | 28%            | 30%            |\n      - name: \"Selectivity at EN-Optimal Layer by Language\"\n        data: |\n          | Tier | Language | Real AUROC | Control AUROC | Selectivity | Artifact? |\n          |------|----------|------------|---------------|-------------|-----------|\n          | HIGH | zh       | 0.732      | 0.498         | 0.234       | No        |\n          | HIGH | es       | 0.741      | 0.495         | 0.246       | No        |\n          | MID  | hi       | 0.665      | 0.502         | 0.163       | No        |\n          | MID  | tr       | 0.655      | 0.508         | 0.147       | No        |\n          | LOW  | sw       | 0.592      | 0.505         | 0.087       | No        |\n          | LOW  | bn       | 0.608      | 0.501         | 0.107       | No        |\n          | LOW  | yo       | 0.542      | 0.510         | 0.032       | YES       |\n          | LOW  | am       | 0.530      | 0.512         | 0.018       | YES       |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Selectivity heatmap: x=20 languages (按 tier 排列)，y=probed layers (按深度)，\n        颜色=selectivity。左下区域（浅层 + 低资源）为深蓝色（artifact zone, selectivity < 0.05）,\n        右上区域（深层 + 高资源）为暖色。虚线框标注 artifact zone boundary。\n        第二行小图：同样 heatmap 但二值化（artifact yes/no），清晰显示 30% LOW + 28% MID 覆盖率。\n    analysis: >\n      Control task 发现是独立的 methodological contribution：首次在 cross-lingual probing 中\n      系统性应用 Hewitt & Liang selectivity analysis，发现 ~30% low-resource 和 ~28%\n      mid-resource language-layer 组合的 probing results 不可靠。Field-level implication:\n      所有 cross-lingual probing 研究（包括 Xiao et al.）应包含 selectivity checks。\n      在 paper 中：(1) 用 selectivity threshold 过滤不可靠结果后重新报告 main results\n      （确认过滤后结论不变），(2) 将过滤信息作为 methodological recommendation\n      在 main body 报告（不只是 appendix），(3) 讨论与 Voita & Titov MDL probes 的关系。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2 EXPERIMENTS (Camera-Ready)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Gemma 4 31B Dense — Third Architecture\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      Dense 架构对照（vs 两个 MoE），60 层 FP16，20+ 语言。\n      提供 dense vs MoE 架构对比。Camera-ready extension。\n    expected_results:\n      en_best_auroc: 0.77\n      en_best_layer: 52\n      en_best_layer_depth_pct: 0.867\n      mean_zs_auroc: 0.655\n      zs_pass_rate: 0.72\n      pareto_strength: \"intermediate (between Qwen3 and Llama4)\"\n      pareto_significant_langs: 13\n      cka_cliff_slope: -0.012\n      cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 0.60\n      partial_rho_cka: 0.22\n      partial_p: 0.045\n      simpson_significant: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Dense 架构的 CKA decline 比 MoE 更渐进（无 expert routing 加速特异化），\n      slope ~-0.012/layer vs MoE 的 -0.015 to -0.025。Pareto 强度介于 Qwen3（最强）\n      和 Llama4（最弱）之间。Simpson's Paradox 在 Gemma 4 上显著（partial rho=0.22,\n      p=0.045）——CKA gradient 斜率介于两者之间，足以使 linear partial correlation 有效。\n      如果 Gemma 4 的 partial correlation 也显著，则 Simpson's Paradox 变为 2/3 架构显著，\n      可强化叙事（但 camera-ready only）。EN AUROC ~0.77 与 Qwen3 的 0.78 接近\n      （31B dense vs 22B active MoE, 参数效率相当）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Three-Architecture Comparison (Camera-Ready)\"\n        data: |\n          | Metric                 | Qwen3-235B | Llama4 Scout | Gemma4 31B |\n          |------------------------|------------|--------------|------------|\n          | Type                   | MoE        | MoE          | Dense      |\n          | Active params          | 22B        | 17B          | 31B        |\n          | Layers                 | 94         | 48           | 60         |\n          | EN best AUROC          | 0.78       | 0.76         | 0.77       |\n          | Mean ZS AUROC          | 0.660      | 0.643        | 0.655      |\n          | Pareto sig langs       | 15         | 11           | 13         |\n          | Partial rho (CKA)      | 0.16 (ns)  | 0.29**       | 0.22*      |\n          | CKA cliff slope        | -0.025     | -0.015       | -0.012     |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        三架构 CKA depth profile 对比：x=normalized depth (0-1)，y=mean CKA (20 langs)。\n        三条线：Qwen3（late sharp cliff），Llama4（early gradual decline），\n        Gemma4（intermediate）。Annotation 标注 cliff onset 和 slope。\n    analysis: >\n      Gemma 4 作为 dense 架构对照，确认 Pareto 和 Simpson's Paradox 不是 MoE 特有。\n      三架构对比暗示 CKA cliff slope 可能是决定 Pareto 强度和 partial correlation\n      显著性的关键因素——但 n=3 架构仅为 suggestive correlation，不能做因果推断。\n      Camera-ready 增加第三个架构使结论更稳健。\n\n  - name: \"Extended Language Coverage (50+ Languages)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      从 20 扩展至 50+ 语言，利用 GlobalMMLU/Belebele 全语言集。Camera-ready extension。\n    expected_results:\n      total_languages: 52\n      zs_pass_rate_52: 0.62\n      artifact_rate_very_low_resource: 0.48\n      new_low_resource_langs_with_artifacts: 18\n      resource_tier_gradient_confirmed: true\n      rank_correlation_20_vs_52: 0.94\n      new_findings: \"diminishing returns; very-low-resource languages (< 1M tokens in training) uniformly fail\"\n      min_zs_auroc: 0.49\n      min_zs_lang: \"Haitian Creole (ht)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      扩展到 52 语言主要增加低资源语言。新增的 32 语言大多为 LOW 或 VERY-LOW resource，\n      ZS AUROC 多在 0.50-0.58 范围。Pass rate 从 20 语言的 ~72% 降到 52 语言的 ~62%，\n      因为新增语言偏向低资源。Resource-tier gradient 在更大规模上确认——artifact rate\n      在 very-low-resource 语言（<1M training tokens）中达 48%，几乎一半结果不可靠。\n      但 20 语言的核心发现在 52 语言上完全保持（rank correlation 0.94）。\n      边际收益递减：每增加一种语言，对核心 claim 的增量证据很小。\n      主要贡献是增加统计功效和覆盖度，而非新发现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Language Coverage Expansion Summary\"\n        data: |\n          | Tier        | 20-lang count | 52-lang count | Mean ZS AUROC | Artifact rate |\n          |-------------|---------------|---------------|---------------|---------------|\n          | HIGH        | 6             | 8             | 0.72          | 4%            |\n          | MID         | 8             | 14            | 0.66          | 22%           |\n          | LOW         | 6             | 18            | 0.57          | 35%           |\n          | VERY-LOW    | 0             | 12            | 0.52          | 48%           |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        World map: 52 语言标注在地图上，颜色编码 ZS AUROC（绿=高，红=低）。\n        清晰显示 Western Europe 和 East Asia 为绿色，Sub-Saharan Africa 和\n        Southeast Asia 低资源语言为红色。\n    analysis: >\n      Camera-ready 的 52 语言扩展提供了更全面的覆盖，但 story 不变。\n      VERY-LOW resource 语言（ht, rm, fy 等）的 ~48% artifact rate 强化了\n      probing control 的必要性。Paper 中报告 52 语言结果但 core analysis\n      仍基于 20 语言（统计方法学更干净）。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4288,"cache_read_input_tokens":41764,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4288},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9de67d78-cf2b-4095-b998-834caafee25d","uuid":"75d4a0f2-9dd1-4e4a-a65c-b47efef6cfda"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":824030,"duration_api_ms":825633,"num_turns":7,"result":"Now I have all the pilot data, CKA analysis, partial correlations, and Pareto results. Let me construct the detailed median-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  CaCLR consistency loss (MMD) 在完整 β sweep 中无显著 AUROC 提升，转为 negative result framing。\n  几何解释：MMD 匹配边际分布但无法对齐低维 directional structure——correctness 方向占据 1-3 维子空间，\n  MMD 在 1-D probe logit 空间操作无法捕捉旋转。Linear projection 直接学习子空间旋转故成功。\n  Simpson's Paradox 仅在 Llama 4 Scout 上显著（partial rho~0.29, p~0.02），Qwen3-235B 上 trending\n  但不显著（rho~0.16, p~0.07）——用 hedged language 报告为架构依赖发现。Claim 2 decomposition\n  定性分离成立但 prescriptive 预测力弱——弱化为 'descriptive separation observed'。\n  标题转向 'When Does Cross-Lingual Calibration Transfer Work? Geometric Analysis and Practical Solutions.'\n  强化三个实用贡献：(1) linear projection ~70 pairs 推荐方案，(2) Procrustes effect reversal 阈值 ~0.55\n  作为 practitioner guidance，(3) ~30% low-resource probing artifacts 作为 methodological warning。\n  仍可投 EACL——thorough empirical study + 架构依赖几何洞见 + systematic negative result + 实用指导。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0 EXPERIMENTS\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Full Pareto Frontier — Qwen3-235B-A22B (MoE, INT4)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      94 层 MoE 模型，每 4 层取一层（24 probed layers），20 种语言，5 种 transfer 条件。\n      MoE 路由机制在深层创建更强的语言特异化，产生比 7B pilot 更清晰的 Pareto tradeoff。\n    expected_results:\n      en_best_auroc: 0.78\n      en_best_layer: 80\n      en_best_layer_depth_pct: 0.851\n      en_auroc_range: [0.58, 0.78]\n      en_best_ece_raw: 0.185\n      transfer_optimal_layer_mean: 68\n      transfer_optimal_depth_pct: 0.723\n      en_transfer_layer_gap_pp: 2.8\n      zs_pass_rate: 0.75\n      zs_pass_count: 15\n      zs_mean_auroc_en_optimal: 0.660\n      zs_mean_auroc_transfer_optimal: 0.682\n      pareto_significant_langs: 15\n      pareto_spearman_rho_median: -0.42\n      pareto_spearman_rho_range: [-0.68, 0.15]\n      pareto_langs_negative_rho: 16\n      best_zs_auroc_by_tier:\n        HIGH_mean: 0.725\n        MID_mean: 0.672\n        LOW_mean: 0.575\n      linear_proj_200_mean_auroc: 0.692\n      few_shot_25_mean_auroc: 0.678\n      few_shot_100_mean_auroc: 0.712\n      mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.000\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen3-235B 的 MoE 路由在深层为不同语言激活不同 expert，加剧表征语言特异化。\n      EN best AUROC 从 7B 的 0.754 提升至 ~0.78（+2.6pp），符合模型规模 scaling 预期（22B active params\n      vs 7B, correctness signal 在更大模型中更强但非线性增长）。EN-optimal 在 L80（85% depth），\n      而非最终层——MoE 最终层 expert 过度特化导致 probe 质量微降。Pareto tradeoff 比 7B 更清晰：\n      MoE 架构下 CKA cliff 更陡（L64-L80 急剧下降），transfer-optimal 在 L68（72% depth），\n      EN-optimal 与 transfer-optimal 相差 ~12 层（~3pp AUROC gap），远大于 7B pilot 的 L24 vs L27（~2pp）。\n      ZS pass rate 75%（15/20）: HIGH 6/6 全通过（共享训练数据充分），MID 6/6 通过（>0.60），\n      LOW 仅 3/6 通过（yo/am/my 低于 0.55）。Mean-shift 仍然恒等于 0（数学不变性）。\n      Linear projection 在低资源语言上提升 +0.04-0.08 但在高资源语言上可能微损。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Per-Language ZS AUROC at EN-Optimal Layer (L80)\"\n        data: |\n          | Tier | Language | ZS AUROC | Best ZS Layer | Pareto rho | Pareto p |\n          |------|----------|----------|---------------|------------|----------|\n          | HIGH | zh       | 0.732    | L68           | -0.52      | 0.009   |\n          | HIGH | es       | 0.741    | L72           | -0.48      | 0.017   |\n          | HIGH | fr       | 0.738    | L72           | -0.45      | 0.027   |\n          | HIGH | de       | 0.720    | L68           | -0.55      | 0.005   |\n          | HIGH | pt       | 0.730    | L72           | -0.41      | 0.046   |\n          | HIGH | ja       | 0.710    | L64           | -0.58      | 0.003   |\n          | MID  | ar       | 0.690    | L64           | -0.50      | 0.013   |\n          | MID  | ru       | 0.700    | L68           | -0.44      | 0.031   |\n          | MID  | ko       | 0.685    | L64           | -0.47      | 0.021   |\n          | MID  | hi       | 0.665    | L60           | -0.38      | 0.068   |\n          | MID  | vi       | 0.678    | L64           | -0.42      | 0.041   |\n          | MID  | tr       | 0.655    | L60           | -0.35      | 0.093   |\n          | LOW  | sw       | 0.592    | L56           | -0.30      | 0.153   |\n          | LOW  | bn       | 0.608    | L60           | -0.32      | 0.126   |\n          | LOW  | th       | 0.620    | L60           | -0.37      | 0.075   |\n          | LOW  | te       | 0.568    | L56           | -0.22      | 0.301   |\n          | LOW  | yo       | 0.542    | L52           | -0.18      | 0.398   |\n          | LOW  | am       | 0.530    | L48           | 0.05       | 0.815   |\n      - name: \"Transfer Method Comparison (mean across 20 languages, L80)\"\n        data: |\n          | Method              | Mean AUROC | ΔAUROC vs ZS | Sig (paired perm) |\n          |---------------------|------------|--------------|-------------------|\n          | Zero-shot           | 0.660      | —            | —                 |\n          | Mean-shift          | 0.660      | 0.000        | n/a               |\n          | CaCLR (best β=0.01) | 0.662      | +0.002       | p=0.42            |\n          | Linear proj (50)    | 0.678      | +0.018       | p=0.008           |\n          | Linear proj (200)   | 0.692      | +0.032       | p<0.001           |\n          | Few-shot 25         | 0.678      | +0.018       | p=0.006           |\n          | Few-shot 100        | 0.712      | +0.052       | p<0.001           |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Pareto scatter plot: 20 个子图（每语言一个），x=EN AUROC, y=ZS AUROC，\n        每点为一个 probed layer（24 点），颜色编码深度（浅=浅层，深=深层），\n        Pareto frontier 用虚线连接。HIGH 语言子图显示清晰的右下弯折（深层 EN 高但 ZS 低），\n        LOW 语言子图点密集在左下区域，frontier 不明显。\n      - >\n        Layer-wise AUROC heatmap: x=20 languages（按 tier 排列），y=24 probed layers（按深度），\n        颜色=ZS AUROC。右上角（深层+低资源）呈冷色（低 AUROC），左中区域（中层+高资源）呈暖色。\n        EN 列单独标注显示 AUROC 随深度单调增加。\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen3-235B 的 MoE 架构产生了比 7B pilot 更清晰的 Pareto frontier：16/20 语言的\n      depth-transfer rho 为负值，其中 15 个在 p<0.10 显著。Pareto 强度与资源 tier 强相关\n      （HIGH rho median=-0.49, MID=-0.43, LOW=-0.27），因为低资源语言整体 AUROC 低、\n      depth variation 也小。MoE 路由机制加速了深层表征的语言特异化——L64-L80 的 expert 激活\n      模式在不同语言间差异显著增大，解释了 transfer cliff 为何比 dense 7B 更陡。\n      EN-optimal（L80）vs transfer-optimal（L68）的 gap 为实际部署提供了明确的 layer selection guidance。\n\n  - name: \"Full Pareto Frontier — Llama 4 Scout (MoE, W4A16)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      48 层 17B-16E MoE，每 4 层取一层（12 probed layers），20 语言，5 transfer 条件。\n      Llama 架构族在 pilot 中显示弱 Pareto，full-scale 预期延续此模式但 MoE 可能略增 Pareto 强度。\n    expected_results:\n      en_best_auroc: 0.76\n      en_best_layer: 44\n      en_best_layer_depth_pct: 0.917\n      en_auroc_range: [0.60, 0.76]\n      en_best_ece_raw: 0.195\n      transfer_optimal_layer_mean: 36\n      transfer_optimal_depth_pct: 0.750\n      en_transfer_layer_gap_pp: 1.5\n      zs_pass_rate: 0.70\n      zs_pass_count: 14\n      zs_mean_auroc_en_optimal: 0.643\n      zs_mean_auroc_transfer_optimal: 0.655\n      pareto_significant_langs: 11\n      pareto_spearman_rho_median: -0.28\n      pareto_spearman_rho_range: [-0.55, 0.35]\n      pareto_langs_negative_rho: 13\n      best_zs_auroc_by_tier:\n        HIGH_mean: 0.705\n        MID_mean: 0.652\n        LOW_mean: 0.558\n      linear_proj_200_mean_auroc: 0.673\n      few_shot_25_mean_auroc: 0.662\n      few_shot_100_mean_auroc: 0.693\n      mean_shift_delta_auroc: 0.000\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama 4 Scout 延续 Llama-3.1-8B pilot 的弱 Pareto 模式：pilot 中仅 2/5 语言显示\n      depth-transfer tradeoff（ar/ko 随深度改善），full-scale 中约 7/20 语言不显示 tradeoff\n      或方向相反。EN AUROC 从 pilot 的 0.728 提升至 0.76（Llama 4 Scout 更大），但提升幅度\n      小于 Qwen3 的 scaling，因为 Llama 4 的 16-expert MoE 在浅层就开始 expert specialization，\n      correctness signal 在中层已经 plateau。Pareto 弱于 Qwen3 的根本原因：Llama CKA decline\n      更渐进（slope -0.015/layer vs Qwen 的 -0.025/layer），导致 transfer 不出现急剧 cliff，\n      tradeoff 分散在更宽的层范围内。EN-optimal（L44）vs transfer-optimal（L36）gap 仅 ~1.5pp，\n      相比 Qwen3 的 ~2.8pp 更小。一些语言（ar, ko, vi）在全深度范围 AUROC 单调增加，\n      无 tradeoff——pilot 中 ar/ko 的异常模式在 full-scale 中得到确认和扩展。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Per-Language Pareto Strength Comparison (Qwen3 vs Llama 4)\"\n        data: |\n          | Tier | Language | Qwen3 rho | Qwen3 p | Llama4 rho | Llama4 p | Pattern       |\n          |------|----------|-----------|---------|------------|----------|---------------|\n          | HIGH | zh       | -0.52     | 0.009   | -0.40      | 0.198    | Both negative |\n          | HIGH | es       | -0.48     | 0.017   | -0.35      | 0.265    | Both negative |\n          | HIGH | ja       | -0.58     | 0.003   | -0.48      | 0.115    | Both negative |\n          | MID  | ar       | -0.50     | 0.013   | +0.15      | 0.641    | DIVERGENT     |\n          | MID  | ko       | -0.47     | 0.021   | +0.22      | 0.489    | DIVERGENT     |\n          | MID  | hi       | -0.38     | 0.068   | -0.55      | 0.065    | Both negative |\n          | LOW  | sw       | -0.30     | 0.153   | -0.25      | 0.432    | Weak both     |\n          | LOW  | yo       | -0.18     | 0.398   | +0.10      | 0.758    | Neither sig   |\n      - name: \"Architecture Comparison Summary\"\n        data: |\n          | Metric                        | Qwen3-235B | Llama 4 Scout |\n          |-------------------------------|------------|---------------|\n          | EN best AUROC                 | 0.78       | 0.76          |\n          | Mean ZS AUROC (EN-opt layer)  | 0.660      | 0.643         |\n          | Pareto significant langs (/20)| 15         | 11            |\n          | Median per-lang Pareto rho    | -0.42      | -0.28         |\n          | CKA cliff onset (% depth)    | ~68%       | ~55%          |\n          | CKA slope (cliff region)      | -0.025/L   | -0.015/L      |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        双模型 Pareto 对比图：左右两列分别为 Qwen3-235B 和 Llama 4 Scout，每行一个 resource tier\n        （HIGH/MID/LOW），每子图叠加该 tier 所有语言的 Pareto frontier（不同颜色）。\n        Qwen3 列显示 frontier 弯折更尖锐，Llama 4 列更平缓。\n    analysis: >\n      两个 MoE 架构的 Pareto 差异确认了 pilot 的架构依赖性发现。关键差异不在 MoE vs dense，\n      而在 CKA depth gradient 的斜率：Qwen3 的急剧 CKA cliff 创建清晰 tradeoff，\n      Llama 4 的渐进下降使 tradeoff 分散。ar/ko 在 Llama 4 上随深度改善的异常模式扩展到\n      full-scale——这些语言在 Llama tokenizer 中有较好的 subword coverage，深层 expert\n      specialization 反而增强了 correctness signal。此架构依赖性是 observational（n=2 架构，\n      混杂 scale/layer count/training data），不做因果归因。\n\n  - name: \"CaCLR Implementation and Negative Result\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      CaCLR (BCE + α·SB-ECE + β·MMD) 完整实现与评估。β sweep 横跨 3 OOM (0.001-1.0)。\n      Median tier 预期：consistency loss 无效，转为 negative result + geometric explanation。\n    expected_results:\n      caclr_mean_delta_auroc_vs_zs: 0.002\n      caclr_best_beta: 0.01\n      caclr_best_alpha: 0.3\n      beta_sweep:\n        beta_0.001: {mean_delta_auroc: 0.001, p_vs_zs: 0.71}\n        beta_0.01: {mean_delta_auroc: 0.003, p_vs_zs: 0.42}\n        beta_0.1: {mean_delta_auroc: -0.002, p_vs_zs: 0.58}\n        beta_1.0: {mean_delta_auroc: -0.008, p_vs_zs: 0.12}\n      alpha_sweep:\n        alpha_0.01: {mean_delta_ece: -0.2, mean_delta_auroc: 0.000}\n        alpha_0.1: {mean_delta_ece: -0.5, mean_delta_auroc: -0.001}\n        alpha_1.0: {mean_delta_ece: -1.5, mean_delta_auroc: -0.004}\n        alpha_10.0: {mean_delta_ece: -2.1, mean_delta_auroc: -0.012}\n      component_ablation:\n        bce_only: {auroc: 0.660, ece: 0.192}\n        bce_sbece: {auroc: 0.658, ece: 0.178}\n        bce_mmd: {auroc: 0.662, ece: 0.190}\n        bce_sbece_mmd: {auroc: 0.661, ece: 0.176}\n      method_comparison_mean_20lang:\n        zero_shot: 0.660\n        mean_shift: 0.660\n        caclr_best: 0.662\n        linear_proj_50: 0.678\n        linear_proj_200: 0.692\n        few_shot_25: 0.678\n        few_shot_100: 0.712\n      caclr_per_tier_delta:\n        HIGH: 0.001\n        MID: 0.003\n        LOW: 0.002\n      implementation_spec:\n        mmd_kernel: \"Gaussian RBF, median heuristic bandwidth\"\n        optimizer: \"Adam, lr=1e-3, cosine schedule\"\n        epochs: 50\n        early_stopping: \"patience=10 on val BCE loss\"\n        initialization: \"from standard LR solution\"\n        batch_size: 256\n        mmd_items: \"same as BCE (probe_train split)\"\n        parallel_set_size_range: [8200, 12800]\n    result_rationale: >\n      CaCLR 的 MMD consistency loss 在 1-D probe logit 空间操作——这是设计层面的根本局限。\n      Correctness direction 是高维 activation 空间中的低维子空间特征（~1-3 维），MMD 匹配\n      probe logit 的边际分布（均值和方差）但无法对齐子空间内的方向结构。具体地：两种语言的\n      probe logit 分布可能有相似的均值和方差（MMD 小），但 correctness direction 在 activation\n      空间中的朝向不同——MMD 无法检测或纠正这种旋转。β=0.001-0.01 时 consistency loss 太弱，\n      无实质效果；β=0.1-1.0 时 consistency loss 开始干扰 BCE 训练（AUROC 下降），因为\n      强制匹配边际分布反而破坏了 EN probe 已经学到的 correctness direction。这不是\n      hyperparameter 问题——是根本的 architectural mismatch。α (SB-ECE) 对 ECE 有轻微改善\n      是预期的（ECE loss 直接优化 calibration），但与 cross-lingual transfer 无关。\n      Linear projection 成功因为它直接学习子空间旋转矩阵（Procrustes alignment），\n      绕过了 distributional matching 的局限。这一对比（MMD 失败 vs linear projection 成功）\n      提供了对 Zhao et al. (2019) conditional-marginal mismatch theory 的实证验证。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"β Sweep Results (Qwen3-235B, L80, mean across 20 languages)\"\n        data: |\n          | β     | Mean AUROC | ΔAUROC vs ZS | 95% Bootstrap CI    | Cohen's d | Interpretation     |\n          |-------|------------|--------------|---------------------|-----------|--------------------|\n          | 0     | 0.660      | —            | —                   | —         | ZS baseline        |\n          | 0.001 | 0.661      | +0.001       | [-0.004, +0.006]    | 0.03      | Negligible         |\n          | 0.01  | 0.663      | +0.003       | [-0.003, +0.009]    | 0.07      | Negligible         |\n          | 0.1   | 0.658      | -0.002       | [-0.008, +0.004]    | 0.05      | Negligible         |\n          | 1.0   | 0.652      | -0.008       | [-0.015, -0.001]    | 0.19      | Slight degradation |\n      - name: \"CaCLR vs All Methods (mean 20 languages, both models)\"\n        data: |\n          | Method            | Qwen3 AUROC | Llama4 AUROC | Mean  | Req. labels | Req. parallel |\n          |-------------------|-------------|--------------|-------|-------------|---------------|\n          | Zero-shot         | 0.660       | 0.643        | 0.652 | 0           | 0             |\n          | Mean-shift        | 0.660       | 0.643        | 0.652 | 0           | N (mean only) |\n          | CaCLR (best)      | 0.662       | 0.645        | 0.654 | 0           | ~10K parallel |\n          | Linear proj (50)  | 0.678       | 0.660        | 0.669 | 0           | 50 pairs      |\n          | Linear proj (200) | 0.692       | 0.673        | 0.683 | 0           | 200 pairs     |\n          | Few-shot 25       | 0.678       | 0.662        | 0.670 | 25          | 0             |\n          | Few-shot 100      | 0.712       | 0.693        | 0.703 | 100         | 0             |\n      - name: \"CKA Subspace Analysis — Why MMD Fails\"\n        data: |\n          | Language Tier | Mean subspace angle (EN-target) | MMD after CaCLR | Angle after CaCLR | Interpretation            |\n          |--------------|----------------------------------|-----------------|--------------------|-----------------------------|\n          | HIGH         | 12°                              | 0.02 → 0.01     | 12° → 11°         | MMD reduces, angle unchanged |\n          | MID          | 24°                              | 0.05 → 0.02     | 24° → 23°         | MMD reduces, angle unchanged |\n          | LOW          | 42°                              | 0.12 → 0.05     | 42° → 40°         | MMD reduces, angle unchanged |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        β sweep 图：x=β (log scale)，y=ΔAUROC vs zero-shot，每条线为一个 resource tier，\n        shaded area 为 bootstrap 95% CI。所有线段在 y=0 附近震荡，β=1.0 时向下偏离。\n        水平虚线标注 linear projection 和 few-shot 的 ΔAUROC 作为对比。\n      - >\n        几何解释概念图：左侧显示 MMD 操作空间（1-D logit 分布），EN 和 target 分布重叠\n        但 correctness direction 指向不同方向（3D activation 空间投影）；右侧显示 linear\n        projection 直接旋转子空间使 direction 对齐。\n    analysis: >\n      CaCLR negative result 的核心贡献不是 method 本身，而是 (1) systematic β sweep 关闭\n      MMD distributional-matching 路径（3 OOM, component ablation, 两个架构 × 20 语言），\n      (2) CKA subspace analysis 提供几何解释——MMD 成功减小了 marginal distance 但完全\n      无法对齐 correctness subspace 的方向（subspace angle 几乎不变）。这验证了\n      Zhao et al. (2019) 的理论预测：当 conditional distributions P(Y|X) 在域间不同时，\n      marginal matching 必然失败。在 correctness probing 中，P(correct|activation) 的\n      条件结构在不同语言间确实不同（语言特异的 capability 成分），因此 MMD 注定无效。\n      Constructive path: linear projection 以 50-80 parallel pairs 的极低成本解决了\n      subspace alignment 问题，是明确的 practical recommendation。\n\n  - name: \"Difficulty-Controlled Decomposition Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      IRT difficulty probes → project out difficulty direction → retrain correctness probes → evaluate transfer。\n      10 代表语言 × 8 代表层 × 两个模型。含 random-direction control。\n      Median tier: 定性分离成立但 prescriptive 预测能力不可靠。\n    expected_results:\n      mean_delta_auroc_difficulty_projected: 0.012\n      delta_auroc_range: [-0.008, 0.025]\n      langs_with_positive_delta: 7\n      langs_with_negative_delta: 3\n      random_direction_mean_delta: 0.005\n      difficulty_vs_random_ratio: 2.4\n      difficulty_probe_r2: 0.35\n      per_lang_results:\n        zh: {delta: 0.008, sig: false}\n        es: {delta: 0.010, sig: false}\n        fr: {delta: 0.012, sig: true}\n        de: {delta: 0.015, sig: true}\n        hi: {delta: 0.022, sig: true}\n        ru: {delta: 0.018, sig: true}\n        ko: {delta: -0.005, sig: false}\n        tr: {delta: 0.020, sig: true}\n        sw: {delta: -0.008, sig: false}\n        bn: {delta: 0.025, sig: true}\n      prescriptive_accuracy: 0.58\n    result_rationale: >\n      Difficulty decomposition 的定性逻辑成立：difficulty 成分确实是跨语言共享的（IRT difficulty\n      与语言无关），project out 后 residual 应该更 capability-specific。但 prescriptive 力弱\n      的原因有三：(1) IRT difficulty probe 的 R²=0.35 意味着 difficulty direction 只解释了\n      35% 的方差，projection 不完全；(2) difficulty 和 capability 在 activation 空间中不正交——\n      projection 同时移除了部分 capability 信息（ko/sw 中 AUROC 下降）；(3) 不同语言中\n      difficulty-capability 纠缠程度不同——高资源语言 capability 独立于 difficulty（projection\n      帮助），低资源语言两者纠缠更深（projection 效果不确定）。Random-direction control\n      显示 ~40% 的效果来自纯维度缩减（从高维投影到低维本身就降噪），只有 ~60% 是\n      difficulty-specific。这足以支持 \"descriptive separation observed\" 但不足以支持\n      \"prescriptive decomposition predicts optimal strategy\"。Prescriptive accuracy 仅 58%\n      （随机猜 50%），几乎无实际预测价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Decomposition Results by Language (Qwen3-235B, 8-layer mean)\"\n        data: |\n          | Language | Tier | Full AUROC | Diff-projected AUROC | ΔAUROC  | Random-proj AUROC | Rand ΔAUROC |\n          |----------|------|------------|----------------------|---------|-------------------|-------------|\n          | zh       | HIGH | 0.725      | 0.733                | +0.008  | 0.729             | +0.004      |\n          | es       | HIGH | 0.735      | 0.745                | +0.010  | 0.740             | +0.005      |\n          | fr       | HIGH | 0.732      | 0.744                | +0.012  | 0.737             | +0.005      |\n          | de       | HIGH | 0.715      | 0.730                | +0.015  | 0.721             | +0.006      |\n          | hi       | MID  | 0.658      | 0.680                | +0.022  | 0.665             | +0.007      |\n          | ru       | MID  | 0.695      | 0.713                | +0.018  | 0.702             | +0.007      |\n          | ko       | MID  | 0.680      | 0.675                | -0.005  | 0.683             | +0.003      |\n          | tr       | MID  | 0.650      | 0.670                | +0.020  | 0.656             | +0.006      |\n          | sw       | LOW  | 0.585      | 0.577                | -0.008  | 0.588             | +0.003      |\n          | bn       | LOW  | 0.602      | 0.627                | +0.025  | 0.608             | +0.006      |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        分解可视化：x=capability ΔAUROC (difficulty-projected - full)，y=difficulty \n        component strength (IRT probe R²)，每点为一个语言。右上象限（高 difficulty 解释力 + \n        positive ΔAUROC）包含 hi/bn/tr（projection 帮助且 difficulty 信号强），左下象限包含\n        ko/sw（projection 损害或无效）。椭圆标注资源 tier。\n    analysis: >\n      Decomposition 分析支持 \"correctness transfer 确实包含 difficulty-shared 和 capability-specific\n      两个成分\" 的定性结论，但 prescriptive accuracy (58%) 与随机猜测差距过小（chance=50%），\n      无法作为实际策略选择工具。弱化 Claim 2 为 \"descriptive separation observed in most\n      language-architecture combinations; however, the decomposition does not reliably predict\n      optimal alignment strategy.\" 纸面贡献仍在：这是首次在跨语言 probing 中尝试 difficulty-\n      capability 分解，定性结果与 Civelli et al. 的 difficulty transfer 文献一致。\n      ko/sw 的反常模式（projection 损害 AUROC）值得单独分析——可能是因为这些语言的\n      difficulty ordering 与英语差异较大（文化特异的知识题目分布不同）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1 EXPERIMENTS\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Lingual Orthogonality Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      提取 verbalized confidence direction，计算与 correctness direction 的 cosine similarity，\n      20 语言 × 2 架构。作为 Claim 4 的 supporting evidence（subsection）。\n    expected_results:\n      mean_cosine_all: 0.038\n      cosine_range: [0.008, 0.142]\n      langs_below_0.05: 14\n      langs_below_0.10: 18\n      langs_above_0.10: 2\n      per_tier_mean_cosine:\n        HIGH: 0.028\n        MID: 0.042\n        LOW: 0.072\n      architecture_comparison:\n        qwen3_mean: 0.035\n        llama4_mean: 0.041\n      outlier_langs: [\"am\", \"yo\"]\n      outlier_cosine: [0.142, 0.118]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Miao & Ungar (2026) 在 English 7-8B 模型上发现 cosine < 0.04。跨语言扩展时，\n      HIGH 资源语言复现此结果（模型在这些语言上有足够训练数据，correctness 和 confidence\n      direction 分化清晰）。MID 语言 cosine 略高（0.04-0.06）因为 confidence direction 在\n      中资源语言上更嘈杂（模型对这些语言的 verbalized confidence 不够稳定）。LOW 语言中\n      am/yo 出现较高 cosine（>0.10）——这不是真正的 correctness-confidence alignment，\n      而是 probe capacity artifact：在低资源语言上两个 direction 都很弱，cosine 被噪声主导。\n      plan_013 control task 将确认这些语言的 selectivity 低于阈值。整体结论不变：\n      orthogonality 是跨语言稳健的结构性质，output-based calibration 的局限性与语言无关。\n      两个架构差异微小（0.035 vs 0.041），不具有统计显著性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cosine Similarity by Resource Tier\"\n        data: |\n          | Tier | n  | Mean cosine | Std  | Min   | Max   | < 0.05 | < 0.10 |\n          |------|----|-------------|------|-------|-------|--------|--------|\n          | HIGH | 6  | 0.028       | 0.012| 0.012 | 0.045 | 5      | 6      |\n          | MID  | 8  | 0.042       | 0.018| 0.018 | 0.075 | 5      | 8      |\n          | LOW  | 6  | 0.072       | 0.042| 0.025 | 0.142 | 2      | 4      |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Bar chart: 20 语言按 cosine 升序排列，颜色编码 resource tier。\n        水平虚线标注 Miao & Ungar 的 0.04 阈值和 0.10 artifact 阈值。\n        大多数 bar 在 0.04 以下，仅 am/yo 突出。\n    analysis: >\n      Orthogonality 作为 subsection supporting evidence 充分：18/20 语言 cosine < 0.10，\n      14/20 < 0.05。结论简洁：\"output-based calibration 的结构性局限（correctness-confidence\n      orthogonality）跨语言稳健，强化了 probe-based 方法的必要性。\" am/yo 的高 cosine\n      值须与 plan_013 control task 结果交叉验证，确认是 probe artifact 而非真实 alignment。\n\n  - name: \"Probe Complexity Comparison (LR vs 2-layer MLP)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      每层每模型对比 logistic regression 和 2-layer MLP 的 EN accuracy、cross-lingual transfer\n      degradation 和 calibration quality。CPU-bound，使用缓存 activations。\n    expected_results:\n      lr_en_best_auroc_qwen3: 0.78\n      mlp_en_best_auroc_qwen3: 0.802\n      lr_mean_zs_auroc_qwen3: 0.660\n      mlp_mean_zs_auroc_qwen3: 0.632\n      lr_transfer_gap_qwen3: 0.120\n      mlp_transfer_gap_qwen3: 0.170\n      lr_en_best_auroc_llama4: 0.76\n      mlp_en_best_auroc_llama4: 0.778\n      lr_mean_zs_auroc_llama4: 0.643\n      mlp_mean_zs_auroc_llama4: 0.618\n      mlp_en_advantage_pp: 2.0\n      lr_transfer_advantage_pp: 2.8\n      lr_preferred_for_transfer: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      MLP（2 层, ~256 hidden units）有更多参数来拟合 EN correctness signal，EN AUROC 提升\n      ~2pp。但额外容量同时学到了 EN-specific 的 activation pattern（如 English 特有的\n      token position bias, subject-verb agreement cues），这些 pattern 不跨语言迁移。\n      LR 被迫学习更简洁的 direction（1 个超平面），这个 direction 更可能对应语言无关的\n      correctness subspace。Transfer gap（EN - mean ZS）: LR 12pp vs MLP 17pp——MLP 多出的\n      5pp gap 恰好对应其 EN advantage 的 2pp + 额外 3pp 的 EN-specific overfitting。\n      这为 paper 的方法论选择（使用 LR probe）提供了实证支持。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"LR vs MLP Transfer Comparison (mean across 20 languages)\"\n        data: |\n          | Metric                    | Qwen3 LR | Qwen3 MLP | Llama4 LR | Llama4 MLP |\n          |---------------------------|----------|-----------|-----------|------------|\n          | EN best AUROC             | 0.780    | 0.802     | 0.760     | 0.778      |\n          | Mean ZS AUROC             | 0.660    | 0.632     | 0.643     | 0.618      |\n          | Transfer gap (EN - ZS)    | 0.120    | 0.170     | 0.117     | 0.160      |\n          | EN ECE                    | 0.185    | 0.172     | 0.195     | 0.182      |\n          | Mean ZS ECE               | 0.225    | 0.252     | 0.232     | 0.260      |\n          | ZS pass rate (>0.60)      | 75%      | 60%       | 70%       | 55%        |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Paired scatter plot: x=LR ZS AUROC, y=MLP ZS AUROC, 每点一个语言，\n        对角线 y=x 标注。大多数点在对角线下方（MLP worse），尤其是低资源语言。\n    analysis: >\n      LR vs MLP 对比验证了 linear probe 是 cross-lingual transfer 的正确选择。\n      MLP 的额外容量在 EN 上有用但在迁移中有害——这与 Hewitt & Liang (2019)\n      关于 probe complexity 的讨论一致。Paper 方法论选择（LR）有实证支持。\n\n  - name: \"Additional Benchmark Evaluation (Belebele + MMLU-ProX)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      在 Belebele（阅读理解）和 MMLU-ProX（翻译 MMLU）上评估 best probes + 所有 transfer\n      方法，验证 generalization beyond GlobalMMLU。20 语言 × 2 模型。\n    expected_results:\n      belebele:\n        en_best_auroc: 0.74\n        mean_zs_auroc: 0.625\n        zs_pass_rate: 0.60\n        pareto_preserved: true\n        pareto_strength: \"weaker than GlobalMMLU\"\n        rank_correlation_with_globalmmlu: 0.82\n      mmlu_prox:\n        en_best_auroc: 0.77\n        mean_zs_auroc: 0.648\n        zs_pass_rate: 0.70\n        pareto_preserved: true\n        pareto_strength: \"comparable to GlobalMMLU\"\n        rank_correlation_with_globalmmlu: 0.91\n      linear_proj_generalizes: true\n      caclr_still_inert: true\n      cross_benchmark_lang_ranking_rho: 0.88\n    result_rationale: >\n      Belebele 是阅读理解任务，与 GlobalMMLU 的知识型 MCQA 不同——correctness signal\n      的性质不完全相同（RC 依赖 passage comprehension, MCQA 依赖 parametric knowledge），\n      所以 EN AUROC 略低（0.74 vs 0.78）且 transfer 更差。但 Pareto 结构保留，因为\n      depth-transferability tradeoff 是 representation geometry 的性质，不依赖特定任务。\n      MMLU-ProX 与 GlobalMMLU 高度相关（同源翻译数据），所以模式几乎一致。\n      Language ranking 在 benchmarks 间高度相关（rho=0.88）——确认结果不是 benchmark-specific。\n      CaCLR 在两个 benchmark 上仍无效，linear projection 仍有效——泛化性确认。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-Benchmark Comparison (mean across 20 languages, Qwen3-235B)\"\n        data: |\n          | Metric             | GlobalMMLU | Belebele | MMLU-ProX |\n          |--------------------|------------|----------|-----------|\n          | EN best AUROC      | 0.78       | 0.74     | 0.77      |\n          | Mean ZS AUROC      | 0.660      | 0.625    | 0.648     |\n          | ZS pass rate       | 75%        | 60%      | 70%       |\n          | Pareto langs (/20) | 15         | 12       | 14        |\n          | Linear proj Δ      | +0.032     | +0.028   | +0.030    |\n          | CaCLR Δ            | +0.002     | +0.001   | +0.002    |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        三 benchmark 平行坐标图：每条线为一个语言，x 轴为三个 benchmark，\n        y 轴为 ZS AUROC。线条颜色编码 resource tier。大多数线大致平行（ranking 一致），\n        但 Belebele 整体偏低。交叉的线表示 benchmark-specific 的语言排名变化。\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-benchmark 泛化确认了主要发现的稳健性。Belebele 上 Pareto 更弱是预期的\n      （RC task 的 correctness signal 与 knowledge MCQA 不同），但关键模式（架构差异、\n      resource tier 梯度、CaCLR 无效、linear projection 有效）在所有 benchmark 上一致。\n      这为 paper 的 claim 提供了必要的泛化验证。\n\n  - name: \"Quantization Validation Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      (a) W4A16 vs FP16 for Llama 4 Scout at 5 layers, 5% subset;\n      (b) GPTQ-Int4 vs FP16 for Qwen3-235B at 5 layers, 5% subset.\n      验证量化不扭曲 correctness signal。\n    expected_results:\n      llama4_w4a16_vs_fp16:\n        mean_abs_delta_auroc: 0.005\n        max_abs_delta_auroc: 0.009\n        direction: \"mixed (2 positive, 3 negative)\"\n        cka_fp16_vs_quant: 0.985\n      qwen3_int4_vs_fp16:\n        mean_abs_delta_auroc: 0.006\n        max_abs_delta_auroc: 0.011\n        direction: \"mixed (3 positive, 2 negative)\"\n        cka_fp16_vs_quant: 0.978\n      quantization_safe: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      4-bit weight quantization 保留了 activation 空间的大部分结构——correctness signal\n      是高维 activation 空间中的低维子空间特征，quantization noise 主要分布在与\n      correctness direction 正交的维度上（根据 random projection 理论，低维结构\n      在高维 noise 下稳健）。ΔAUROC < 0.01 在 bootstrap CI 内，不影响任何结论。\n      Qwen3 的 MoE 量化略有更大 delta（expert routing 决策在 INT4 下可能微变），\n      但仍在可接受范围。CKA(FP16, quant) > 0.97 确认 activation 空间整体结构保留。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Quantization Validation (per-layer ΔAUROC)\"\n        data: |\n          | Model      | Layer (% depth) | FP16 AUROC | Quant AUROC | ΔAUROC  |\n          |------------|-----------------|------------|-------------|---------|\n          | Llama4     | L8 (17%)        | 0.632      | 0.629       | -0.003  |\n          | Llama4     | L16 (33%)       | 0.685      | 0.688       | +0.003  |\n          | Llama4     | L24 (50%)       | 0.720      | 0.715       | -0.005  |\n          | Llama4     | L36 (75%)       | 0.748      | 0.741       | -0.007  |\n          | Llama4     | L44 (92%)       | 0.760      | 0.762       | +0.002  |\n          | Qwen3      | L16 (17%)       | 0.628      | 0.622       | -0.006  |\n          | Qwen3      | L36 (38%)       | 0.702      | 0.705       | +0.003  |\n          | Qwen3      | L52 (55%)       | 0.738      | 0.734       | -0.004  |\n          | Qwen3      | L68 (72%)       | 0.768      | 0.772       | +0.004  |\n          | Qwen3      | L80 (85%)       | 0.780      | 0.769       | -0.011  |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Bland-Altman plot: x=(FP16+Quant)/2, y=FP16-Quant, 每点为一层。\n        水平虚线标注 ±0.01 tolerance band。所有点在 band 内。\n    analysis: >\n      Quantization validation 通过——所有 ΔAUROC < 0.012，CKA > 0.97。\n      Qwen3 L80 的 ΔAUROC=-0.011 是最大偏差，但仍在 bootstrap CI 范围内\n      且不影响 EN-optimal layer 的选择。Paper 中报告为 \"quantization artifacts\n      are negligible for correctness probing (max |ΔAUROC| < 0.012 across all\n      validated layers)\"。\n\n  - name: \"Full CKA Cross-Lingual Similarity & Simpson's Paradox Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      Linear CKA between EN and 20 target languages at every probed layer, both models.\n      核心分析：partial correlation controlling for depth（Simpson's Paradox 验证）。\n      Median tier: 仅 Llama 4 Scout 上显著，Qwen3 上 trending but not significant。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen3:\n        raw_spearman_cka_auroc: -0.22\n        raw_p: 0.001\n        partial_spearman_ctrl_depth: 0.16\n        partial_p: 0.072\n        significant: false\n        per_layer_positive_rho_count: 17\n        per_layer_total: 24\n        per_layer_significant_count: 5\n        cka_cliff_onset_layer: 64\n        cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 0.68\n        cka_final_layer_mean: 0.10\n        cka_peak_layer: 36\n        cka_peak_mean: 0.81\n      llama4:\n        raw_spearman_cka_auroc: -0.28\n        raw_p: 0.001\n        partial_spearman_ctrl_depth: 0.29\n        partial_p: 0.018\n        significant: true\n        per_layer_positive_rho_count: 10\n        per_layer_total: 12\n        per_layer_significant_count: 4\n        cka_cliff_onset_layer: 24\n        cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 0.50\n        cka_final_layer_mean: 0.22\n        cka_peak_layer: 12\n        cka_peak_mean: 0.82\n      simpson_paradox_confirmed: \"partial (1/2 architectures)\"\n      subspace_angle_analysis:\n        qwen3_mean_angle_HIGH: 10\n        qwen3_mean_angle_MID: 22\n        qwen3_mean_angle_LOW: 45\n        llama4_mean_angle_HIGH: 12\n        llama4_mean_angle_MID: 25\n        llama4_mean_angle_LOW: 40\n      cka_transfer_collapse_threshold: 0.32\n      bootstrap_ci_partial_rho_qwen3: [-0.02, 0.34]\n      bootstrap_ci_partial_rho_llama4: [0.06, 0.50]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Simpson's Paradox 的架构依赖性源于 CKA-depth gradient 的形状差异。\n      Llama 4 Scout 的 CKA depth gradient 更陡峭（从 peak 0.82 at L12 到 final 0.22 at L48,\n      slope ~ -0.017/layer），这使得 depth confound 更强——controlling for depth 释放了更多\n      CKA 的独立解释力（partial rho=0.29, p=0.018）。Qwen3 的 CKA decline 起始更晚\n      （L64 才开始急降）且更集中在最深层，depth confound 的影响不均匀——前 60% 层几乎\n      无 CKA 变化，后 30% 急降——这种非线性使得 linear partial correlation 效果较差\n      （partial rho=0.16, p=0.072）。这不意味 CKA 在 Qwen3 上无解释力，而是 linear\n      depth control 不够——可能需要 non-linear depth control（如 depth²）才能捕捉 Qwen3\n      的 step-function-like CKA profile。但 paper 应诚实报告：standard partial correlation\n      仅在 Llama 上显著。Per-layer analysis: 两个模型 70-83% 的 per-layer rho 为正（Qwen 17/24,\n      Llama 10/12），但因每层仅 n=20 语言，个别层的 significance 有限。Full-scale 的\n      n=20 per layer 比 pilot 的 n=5 有更多 power，但仍不足以让所有 per-layer rho 显著。\n      Subspace angle 分析提供定量补充：HIGH 语言角度小（10-12°）→ 零样本迁移好，\n      LOW 语言角度大（40-45°）→ 需要 alignment。CKA collapse threshold ~0.32 是 transfer\n      从 \"reasonable\" 骤降到 \"chance-level\" 的拐点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Simpson's Paradox — Raw vs Partial Correlation\"\n        data: |\n          | Model       | n   | Raw rho | Raw p   | Partial rho | Partial p | Boot 95% CI      | Sig?   |\n          |-------------|-----|---------|---------|-------------|-----------|------------------|--------|\n          | Qwen3-235B  | 480 | -0.22   | <0.001  | +0.16       | 0.072     | [-0.02, +0.34]   | No     |\n          | Llama4 Scout| 240 | -0.28   | <0.001  | +0.29       | 0.018     | [+0.06, +0.50]   | Yes    |\n          | Pilot Llama | 45  | -0.16   | 0.294   | +0.41       | 0.006     | [+0.12, +0.65]   | Yes    |\n          | Pilot Qwen  | 40  | -0.16   | 0.310   | +0.18       | 0.274     | [-0.15, +0.48]   | No     |\n      - name: \"Per-Layer Cross-Language Spearman (CKA vs AUROC, n=20 per layer)\"\n        data: |\n          | Layer group        | Qwen3 median rho | Qwen3 sig layers | Llama4 median rho | Llama4 sig layers |\n          |--------------------|------------------|------------------|-------------------|-------------------|\n          | 0-25% depth        | +0.15            | 0/6              | +0.22             | 1/3               |\n          | 25-50% depth       | +0.38            | 2/6              | +0.45             | 2/3               |\n          | 50-75% depth       | +0.42            | 2/6              | +0.52             | 2/3               |\n          | 75-100% depth      | +0.28            | 1/6              | +0.35             | 1/3               |\n      - name: \"CKA Depth Profile (mean across 20 languages)\"\n        data: |\n          | Depth % | Qwen3 Layer | Qwen3 CKA | Llama4 Layer | Llama4 CKA |\n          |---------|-------------|-----------|--------------|------------|\n          | 0%      | 0           | 0.72      | 0            | 0.60       |\n          | 17%     | 16          | 0.75      | 8            | 0.80       |\n          | 34%     | 32          | 0.80      | 16           | 0.76       |\n          | 51%     | 48          | 0.78      | 24           | 0.58       |\n          | 68%     | 64          | 0.62      | 32           | 0.42       |\n          | 77%     | 72          | 0.40      | 36           | 0.35       |\n          | 85%     | 80          | 0.25      | 40           | 0.30       |\n          | 94%     | 88          | 0.14      | 44           | 0.25       |\n          | 100%    | 92          | 0.10      | 48           | 0.22       |\n      - name: \"Subspace Angle Analysis (correctness direction EN vs target)\"\n        data: |\n          | Tier | Qwen3 mean angle | Llama4 mean angle | Mean ZS AUROC | Interpretation         |\n          |------|------------------|-------------------|---------------|------------------------|\n          | HIGH | 10°              | 12°               | 0.715         | Near-aligned           |\n          | MID  | 22°              | 25°               | 0.662         | Modest rotation        |\n          | LOW  | 45°              | 40°               | 0.567         | Substantial misalignment|\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Simpson's Paradox 可视化（核心图）：scatter plot, x=CKA, y=ZS AUROC。\n        每点为一个 (layer, language) pair。颜色编码 normalized depth (0-1)。\n        左图 Qwen3 (480 points)，右图 Llama4 (240 points)。\n        Overall trend line 斜率为负（黑色虚线），per-depth-bin trend lines 斜率为正\n        （彩色实线，对应不同深度 bin）。Sign reversal 清晰可见。\n        Annotation: \"Raw rho=−0.22 (p<0.001) vs Partial rho=+0.16 (p=0.07)\" for Qwen3,\n        \"Raw rho=−0.28 (p<0.001) vs Partial rho=+0.29 (p=0.018)\" for Llama4.\n      - >\n        CKA × layer × language heatmap: 两个 panel（一个 per model），x=20 languages\n        （按 mean CKA 排序），y=probed layers。颜色=CKA 值。显示 CKA cliff 在 Qwen3 上\n        更突然（L64 以上的条带从暖色骤变冷色），在 Llama4 上更渐进。\n    analysis: >\n      Simpson's Paradox 在 full-scale 上部分确认：Llama 4 Scout 上统计显著（partial rho=0.29,\n      p=0.018），Qwen3-235B 上 trending 但不显著（partial rho=0.16, p=0.072）。\n      这一架构依赖性本身是有意义的发现。Paper 中用 hedged language 报告：\n      \"In architectures where the CKA-depth gradient is steep (Llama 4 Scout),\n      partial correlation controlling for depth reveals a significant positive\n      relationship between CKA and transfer AUROC (rho=0.29, p=0.018),\n      indicating that CKA provides genuine explanatory power beyond depth.\n      In architectures with a delayed, step-function-like CKA decline (Qwen3-235B),\n      the linear partial correlation is trending but not significant (rho=0.16, p=0.072),\n      possibly because the non-linear depth-CKA relationship reduces the effectiveness\n      of linear depth control.\"\n      Subspace angle analysis 提供了 CKA 分析的定量补充——HIGH 语言角度小（zero-shot 可行），\n      LOW 语言角度大（需要 alignment）——这与 Procrustes reversal 发现互洽。\n\n  - name: \"Linear Projection Sensitivity & Procrustes Effect Reversal\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      Vary parallel pairs (10, 20, 50, 100, 200) for linear projection。\n      两模型 × 5 代表层 × 20 语言。Resource-tier stratified saturation curves。\n      含 Procrustes effect reversal 分析。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_pairs_to_95pct: 70\n      per_tier_pairs_to_95pct:\n        HIGH: 35\n        MID: 55\n        LOW: 75\n      saturation_curve:\n        pairs_10: {pct_of_max: 0.42, mean_delta_auroc: 0.013}\n        pairs_20: {pct_of_max: 0.62, mean_delta_auroc: 0.020}\n        pairs_50: {pct_of_max: 0.84, mean_delta_auroc: 0.027}\n        pairs_100: {pct_of_max: 0.95, mean_delta_auroc: 0.030}\n        pairs_200: {pct_of_max: 1.00, mean_delta_auroc: 0.032}\n      procrustes_reversal:\n        threshold_estimate: 0.55\n        threshold_ci_95: [0.46, 0.63]\n        benefit_below_0.50: {mean_delta: +0.058, n_langs: 4}\n        ambiguous_0.50_0.62: {mean_delta: +0.012, n_langs: 8}\n        harm_above_0.62: {mean_delta: -0.018, n_langs: 8}\n      curve_cleanness: \"noisy, especially LOW tier (R² of saturation fit: HIGH=0.96, MID=0.91, LOW=0.78)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Linear projection（Procrustes alignment）通过学习 EN→target 的旋转矩阵对齐 correctness\n      subspace。Saturation 速度取决于子空间旋转的复杂度：HIGH 语言的 EN-target subspace\n      角度小（~10°），10-20 pairs 就足以估计一个简单旋转，35 pairs 达到 95%；LOW 语言角度大\n      （~40-45°），需要更多 pairs 来稳定估计更复杂的旋转，75 pairs 才达到 95%。\n      Overall 70 pairs（而非 pilot 预估的 ~50 pairs）因为 (1) 20 语言比 5 语言引入更多方差，\n      (2) 部分低资源语言的 parallel data 翻译质量低（机翻 artifacts），增加了 noise。\n      Curves 在 LOW tier 不够干净（R²=0.78）——个别语言的饱和曲线不单调（20 pairs 时偶然\n      好于 50 pairs），因为 parallel pair 的质量方差大。\n      Procrustes reversal 的机制：当 ZS AUROC 已高（>0.62），EN probe 的 correctness direction\n      与 target 语言已经 well-aligned（subspace angle <15°），Procrustes 旋转引入的估计噪声\n      反而大于 alignment gain→净效果为负。当 ZS AUROC 低（<0.50），严重 misalignment\n      （angle >40°）使得 Procrustes 的 alignment gain 远大于估计噪声→净效果明显为正。\n      阈值 ~0.55 对应 subspace angle ~20-25° 的平衡点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Saturation Curves by Resource Tier (Qwen3-235B, L68)\"\n        data: |\n          | Pairs | HIGH ΔAUROC | MID ΔAUROC | LOW ΔAUROC | Overall ΔAUROC |\n          |-------|-------------|------------|------------|----------------|\n          | 10    | +0.002      | +0.010     | +0.028     | +0.013         |\n          | 20    | +0.005      | +0.018     | +0.042     | +0.020         |\n          | 50    | +0.007      | +0.026     | +0.054     | +0.027         |\n          | 100   | +0.008      | +0.029     | +0.060     | +0.030         |\n          | 200   | +0.008      | +0.030     | +0.063     | +0.032         |\n      - name: \"Procrustes Effect Reversal by ZS AUROC Band\"\n        data: |\n          | ZS AUROC band | n langs | Mean Δ from proj | Std   | % positive | Example langs |\n          |---------------|---------|------------------|-------|------------|---------------|\n          | < 0.50        | 4       | +0.058           | 0.022 | 100%       | am, yo, my, te|\n          | 0.50 - 0.55   | 2       | +0.035           | 0.018 | 100%       | sw, bn        |\n          | 0.55 - 0.60   | 2       | +0.012           | 0.015 | 75%        | th, tr        |\n          | 0.60 - 0.65   | 4       | +0.003           | 0.012 | 50%        | hi, vi, ko, ar|\n          | 0.65 - 0.70   | 4       | -0.008           | 0.010 | 25%        | ru, ja, de, pt|\n          | > 0.70        | 4       | -0.018           | 0.008 | 0%         | zh, es, fr, ...  |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Saturation curve plot: x=number of parallel pairs (log scale), y=ΔAUROC vs zero-shot。\n        三条线（HIGH/MID/LOW tier），每条带 shaded bootstrap 95% CI。\n        HIGH 线快速 plateau（30-40 pairs 后几乎 flat），LOW 线缓慢上升且 CI 更宽。\n        Horizontal dashed line 标注 \"95% of max improvement\"。\n      - >\n        Procrustes reversal scatter: x=ZS AUROC (zero-shot baseline), y=ΔAUROC from linear\n        projection (200 pairs)。每点一个 (language, model) pair，颜色编码 model。\n        LOESS 拟合曲线显示从正到负的渐变。Vertical band 标注 reversal threshold 及 95% CI。\n    analysis: >\n      Linear projection 的 sample efficiency 是最直接的 practical contribution：\n      70 parallel pairs（约 2-3 小时标注工作）达到 95% of maximum improvement。\n      Resource-tier stratification 为 practitioners 提供指导：HIGH 语言不需要 projection\n      （可能有害），LOW 语言需要 ~75 pairs。Procrustes reversal 是重要的 practitioner caveat：\n      不加区分地对所有语言做 alignment 会损害已经 well-aligned 的语言。\n      建议 deployment strategy: 先测试 zero-shot AUROC，低于 0.55 时使用 linear projection，\n      高于 0.62 时直接使用 zero-shot。\n\n  - name: \"Probing Control Tasks (Hewitt & Liang 2019) — Full Scale\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      随机排列标签训练 control probes，计算 selectivity (real - control AUROC)，\n      2 模型 × 20 语言 × 所有 probed 层。验证 AUROC 反映 genuine correctness direction。\n    expected_results:\n      artifact_rate_low_resource: 0.30\n      artifact_rate_mid_resource: 0.28\n      artifact_rate_high_resource: 0.06\n      artifact_threshold_selectivity: 0.05\n      overall_artifact_rate: 0.18\n      en_selectivity_profile:\n        shallow: 0.03\n        mid: 0.12\n        deep: 0.25\n      per_tier_selectivity_deep_layers:\n        HIGH: 0.22\n        MID: 0.14\n        LOW: 0.06\n      control_auroc_range: [0.48, 0.52]\n      affected_layer_range: \"primarily layers 0-40% depth\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Pilot（Qwen2.5-7B, EN）显示 selectivity 在浅层低（L0-L12: 0.02-0.04）、深层高\n      （L20-L27: 0.24-0.26）。跨语言扩展时，LOW 资源语言的 selectivity 全面下降：\n      (1) 这些语言的 activations 中 correctness signal 更弱（模型对这些语言\"知道\"更少），\n      (2) probe 在小 activation difference 上更依赖 capacity 来拟合训练集。\n      LOW 资源语言在深层的 selectivity 仅 ~0.06（vs EN 的 ~0.25），许多 layer-language\n      组合的 selectivity < 0.05 artifact threshold。30% 的 LOW resource layer-language\n      组合为 artifacts。MID 资源语言出乎意料地也有 ~28% artifact rate——这是因为\n      MID 资源语言中包含一些 \"表面高资源但 knowledge coverage 低\" 的语言（如 tr, vi:\n      模型训练数据中 token 多但 MMLU 领域覆盖差）。HIGH 资源语言 artifact rate 仅 6%\n      （仅在最浅层 L0-L4）。这一发现波及范围比初始预期更广（从 \"~28% low-resource\"\n      扩展到 \"~28% low + ~28% mid\"），强化了 methodological warning 的重要性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Artifact Rate by Resource Tier and Depth (Qwen3-235B)\"\n        data: |\n          | Depth zone     | HIGH artifact % | MID artifact % | LOW artifact % |\n          |----------------|-----------------|----------------|----------------|\n          | 0-25% depth    | 17%             | 58%            | 83%            |\n          | 25-50% depth   | 4%              | 33%            | 67%            |\n          | 50-75% depth   | 0%              | 17%            | 17%            |\n          | 75-100% depth  | 0%              | 4%             | 0%             |\n          | Overall        | 6%              | 28%            | 30%            |\n      - name: \"Selectivity at EN-Optimal Layer by Language\"\n        data: |\n          | Tier | Language | Real AUROC | Control AUROC | Selectivity | Artifact? |\n          |------|----------|------------|---------------|-------------|-----------|\n          | HIGH | zh       | 0.732      | 0.498         | 0.234       | No        |\n          | HIGH | es       | 0.741      | 0.495         | 0.246       | No        |\n          | MID  | hi       | 0.665      | 0.502         | 0.163       | No        |\n          | MID  | tr       | 0.655      | 0.508         | 0.147       | No        |\n          | LOW  | sw       | 0.592      | 0.505         | 0.087       | No        |\n          | LOW  | bn       | 0.608      | 0.501         | 0.107       | No        |\n          | LOW  | yo       | 0.542      | 0.510         | 0.032       | YES       |\n          | LOW  | am       | 0.530      | 0.512         | 0.018       | YES       |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Selectivity heatmap: x=20 languages (按 tier 排列)，y=probed layers (按深度)，\n        颜色=selectivity。左下区域（浅层 + 低资源）为深蓝色（artifact zone, selectivity < 0.05）,\n        右上区域（深层 + 高资源）为暖色。虚线框标注 artifact zone boundary。\n        第二行小图：同样 heatmap 但二值化（artifact yes/no），清晰显示 30% LOW + 28% MID 覆盖率。\n    analysis: >\n      Control task 发现是独立的 methodological contribution：首次在 cross-lingual probing 中\n      系统性应用 Hewitt & Liang selectivity analysis，发现 ~30% low-resource 和 ~28%\n      mid-resource language-layer 组合的 probing results 不可靠。Field-level implication:\n      所有 cross-lingual probing 研究（包括 Xiao et al.）应包含 selectivity checks。\n      在 paper 中：(1) 用 selectivity threshold 过滤不可靠结果后重新报告 main results\n      （确认过滤后结论不变），(2) 将过滤信息作为 methodological recommendation\n      在 main body 报告（不只是 appendix），(3) 讨论与 Voita & Titov MDL probes 的关系。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2 EXPERIMENTS (Camera-Ready)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Gemma 4 31B Dense — Third Architecture\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      Dense 架构对照（vs 两个 MoE），60 层 FP16，20+ 语言。\n      提供 dense vs MoE 架构对比。Camera-ready extension。\n    expected_results:\n      en_best_auroc: 0.77\n      en_best_layer: 52\n      en_best_layer_depth_pct: 0.867\n      mean_zs_auroc: 0.655\n      zs_pass_rate: 0.72\n      pareto_strength: \"intermediate (between Qwen3 and Llama4)\"\n      pareto_significant_langs: 13\n      cka_cliff_slope: -0.012\n      cka_cliff_onset_depth_pct: 0.60\n      partial_rho_cka: 0.22\n      partial_p: 0.045\n      simpson_significant: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Dense 架构的 CKA decline 比 MoE 更渐进（无 expert routing 加速特异化），\n      slope ~-0.012/layer vs MoE 的 -0.015 to -0.025。Pareto 强度介于 Qwen3（最强）\n      和 Llama4（最弱）之间。Simpson's Paradox 在 Gemma 4 上显著（partial rho=0.22,\n      p=0.045）——CKA gradient 斜率介于两者之间，足以使 linear partial correlation 有效。\n      如果 Gemma 4 的 partial correlation 也显著，则 Simpson's Paradox 变为 2/3 架构显著，\n      可强化叙事（但 camera-ready only）。EN AUROC ~0.77 与 Qwen3 的 0.78 接近\n      （31B dense vs 22B active MoE, 参数效率相当）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Three-Architecture Comparison (Camera-Ready)\"\n        data: |\n          | Metric                 | Qwen3-235B | Llama4 Scout | Gemma4 31B |\n          |------------------------|------------|--------------|------------|\n          | Type                   | MoE        | MoE          | Dense      |\n          | Active params          | 22B        | 17B          | 31B        |\n          | Layers                 | 94         | 48           | 60         |\n          | EN best AUROC          | 0.78       | 0.76         | 0.77       |\n          | Mean ZS AUROC          | 0.660      | 0.643        | 0.655      |\n          | Pareto sig langs       | 15         | 11           | 13         |\n          | Partial rho (CKA)      | 0.16 (ns)  | 0.29**       | 0.22*      |\n          | CKA cliff slope        | -0.025     | -0.015       | -0.012     |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        三架构 CKA depth profile 对比：x=normalized depth (0-1)，y=mean CKA (20 langs)。\n        三条线：Qwen3（late sharp cliff），Llama4（early gradual decline），\n        Gemma4（intermediate）。Annotation 标注 cliff onset 和 slope。\n    analysis: >\n      Gemma 4 作为 dense 架构对照，确认 Pareto 和 Simpson's Paradox 不是 MoE 特有。\n      三架构对比暗示 CKA cliff slope 可能是决定 Pareto 强度和 partial correlation\n      显著性的关键因素——但 n=3 架构仅为 suggestive correlation，不能做因果推断。\n      Camera-ready 增加第三个架构使结论更稳健。\n\n  - name: \"Extended Language Coverage (50+ Languages)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      从 20 扩展至 50+ 语言，利用 GlobalMMLU/Belebele 全语言集。Camera-ready extension。\n    expected_results:\n      total_languages: 52\n      zs_pass_rate_52: 0.62\n      artifact_rate_very_low_resource: 0.48\n      new_low_resource_langs_with_artifacts: 18\n      resource_tier_gradient_confirmed: true\n      rank_correlation_20_vs_52: 0.94\n      new_findings: \"diminishing returns; very-low-resource languages (< 1M tokens in training) uniformly fail\"\n      min_zs_auroc: 0.49\n      min_zs_lang: \"Haitian Creole (ht)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      扩展到 52 语言主要增加低资源语言。新增的 32 语言大多为 LOW 或 VERY-LOW resource，\n      ZS AUROC 多在 0.50-0.58 范围。Pass rate 从 20 语言的 ~72% 降到 52 语言的 ~62%，\n      因为新增语言偏向低资源。Resource-tier gradient 在更大规模上确认——artifact rate\n      在 very-low-resource 语言（<1M training tokens）中达 48%，几乎一半结果不可靠。\n      但 20 语言的核心发现在 52 语言上完全保持（rank correlation 0.94）。\n      边际收益递减：每增加一种语言，对核心 claim 的增量证据很小。\n      主要贡献是增加统计功效和覆盖度，而非新发现。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Language Coverage Expansion Summary\"\n        data: |\n          | Tier        | 20-lang count | 52-lang count | Mean ZS AUROC | Artifact rate |\n          |-------------|---------------|---------------|---------------|---------------|\n          | HIGH        | 6             | 8             | 0.72          | 4%            |\n          | MID         | 8             | 14            | 0.66          | 22%           |\n          | LOW         | 6             | 18            | 0.57          | 35%           |\n          | VERY-LOW    | 0             | 12            | 0.52          | 48%           |\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        World map: 52 语言标注在地图上，颜色编码 ZS AUROC（绿=高，红=低）。\n        清晰显示 Western Europe 和 East Asia 为绿色，Sub-Saharan Africa 和\n        Southeast Asia 低资源语言为红色。\n    analysis: >\n      Camera-ready 的 52 语言扩展提供了更全面的覆盖，但 story 不变。\n      VERY-LOW resource 语言（ht, rm, fy 等）的 ~48% artifact rate 强化了\n      probing control 的必要性。Paper 中报告 52 语言结果但 core analysis\n      仍基于 20 语言（统计方法学更干净）。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"9de67d78-cf2b-4095-b998-834caafee25d","total_cost_usd":1.29194325,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34605,"cache_read_input_tokens":113414,"output_tokens":40260,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34605,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":39627,"cache_read_input_tokens":41764,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4288,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4288},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":12315,"outputTokens":23,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.01243,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":5,"outputTokens":40260,"cacheReadInputTokens":113414,"cacheCreationInputTokens":34605,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.27951325,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"f6c2029d-d91e-4b14-9dd5-e747e39b9099"}
